msgid "Architecture Design"
msgstr "架構設計"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:3 729f11830fe64a30ae1b31c8ad3b847e
msgid ""
"A stateful C++ pricing backend driving a TypeScript frontend over "
"WebSocket, with Protobuf as the wire format."
msgstr "一個有狀態的 C++ 定價後端，透過 WebSocket 驅動 TypeScript 前端，以 Protobuf 作為傳輸格式。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:6 e86f025942a44ce3a8681447efd4ec9a
msgid ""
"This document records the design decisions and, more importantly, the "
"QuantLib constraints that force them. Claims about the library are cited "
"against `third_party/QuantLib`, the submodule this repository pins at "
"v1.43, so the line numbers hold against a fixed tree rather than against "
"whichever QuantLib happens to be installed. Most carry a line or a range;"
" the rest name a file or a whole directory, which is all a claim about an"
" *absence* can be cited to — §3 rests on one of those. Source comments "
"cite back to this document by section, as `DESIGN §2.1`."
msgstr "這份文件記錄設計上的決定，而更重要的是記錄迫使這些決定成立的 QuantLib 限制。關於函式庫的說法都引用 `third_party/QuantLib`——本儲存庫釘在 v1.43 的子模組——因此行號對應的是一棵固定的原始碼樹，而不是剛好安裝在機器上的那一版 QuantLib。大多數引用附上一行或一段範圍；其餘則指名一個檔案或整個目錄，因為關於某樣東西*不存在*的說法，也只能這樣引用——§3 就建立在其中一條之上。原始碼中的註解則以章節回頭引用這份文件，寫成 `DESIGN §2.1`。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:15 b25ba87224de494291e725fc8b3f6a68
msgid ""
"Build instructions are on the [build page](INSTALL.md); current status "
"and the file map are in the [overview](index.md). Where the design and "
"the code differ, the section says so — today that is §3: workers are "
"threads in the gateway process, so the kill half of a cancel is a disown "
"rather than a kill."
msgstr "建置步驟在[建置頁面](INSTALL.md)；目前的狀態與檔案地圖在[總覽](index.md)。凡是設計與程式碼不一致之處，該節都會明說——目前是 §3：工作者是閘道行程裡的執行緒，所以取消中 kill 的那一半是棄置，而不是真正的 kill。"

