#: ../../DESIGN.md:46 9787edef3233423fbd68fe90eb7e29a2
msgid "1. Shape"
msgstr "1. 整體形狀"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:71 f27dfb616c0b48a8bdf3634628221ef0
msgid ""
"Two things hold for every worker in that picture, and are the subject of "
"§2 and §3 respectively:"
msgstr "上圖中的每一個工作者都有兩件事成立，分別是 §2 與 §3 的主題："

#: ../../DESIGN.md:74 663d18848d6f460db12288f898d29576
msgid ""
"**Every worker is built with `QL_ENABLE_SESSIONS`**, holds one client "
"session per thread, and keeps that session's QuantLib object graph alive "
"between requests."
msgstr "**每個工作者都以 `QL_ENABLE_SESSIONS` 建置**，每條執行緒持有一個用戶端工作階段，並在請求之間讓該工作階段的 QuantLib 物件圖保持存活。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:77 60664ea3214044a389805f5e9e0676f5
msgid ""
"**A cancel asks first and kills second.** The worker is asked to stop at "
"its next step; it is killed only if the request outlives the grace, and "
"the session log is then replayed into a fresh worker. `session_id` "
"survives either path, and every request is cancellable — what differs is "
"whether it keeps its partial results."
msgstr "**取消先請求，再 kill**。工作者先被要求在下一步停下；只有當請求撐過寬限期時才會被 kill，之後工作階段日誌會重播到一個新的工作者中。無論哪條路徑，`session_id` 都會保留，而且每個請求都能取消——差別只在於它能不能保留部分結果。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:83 d0122aca0e114d419637edd8c8e92178
msgid ""
"The gateway owns sockets, correlation ids, and backpressure. Workers own "
"QuantLib. They are separate processes, for the reason in §3 — in the "
"design. What runs today is `ThreadProcessHost`, which makes them thread "
"groups in the gateway process and therefore cannot honour a kill; §3 says"
" what that costs."
msgstr "閘道擁有連線、關聯代號與背壓。工作者擁有 QuantLib。在設計上它們是各自獨立的行程，理由見 §3。目前實際執行的是 `ThreadProcessHost`，它讓工作者成為閘道行程中的執行緒群組，因此無法兌現 kill；§3 說明了這樣的代價。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:88 64fc0ac990e6411ab6059e588d4f58cd
msgid ""
"The gateway also owns the clock. The supervisor has no thread and no "
"timer of its own — every entry point is called from the gateway's loop — "
"so the deferred half of a cancel comes back the same way: the gateway "
"arms the grace timer and reports each terminal frame it forwards, which "
"is how the supervisor tells a request that stopped politely from one that"
" has to be killed."
msgstr "閘道也擁有時鐘。監督者自己沒有執行緒也沒有計時器——每個進入點都從閘道的迴圈呼叫——所以取消中延後的那一半也從同一條路回來：閘道設定寬限計時器，並回報它轉送的每一個終結訊框，監督者就是靠這個分辨客氣停下的請求與必須被 kill 的請求。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:94 dccdbb2c80964f76905772bcbd6390af
msgid ""
"WebSocket already delimits messages, so frames carry no length prefix — "
"one serialized `ClientFrame` or `ServerFrame` per binary WebSocket "
"message."
msgstr "WebSocket 本身已經為訊息劃分邊界，所以訊框不帶長度前綴——每則二進位 WebSocket 訊息就是一個序列化的 `ClientFrame` 或 `ServerFrame`。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:97 62e9e5f3cbf84691a980dc499f91625f
msgid "1.1 Process topology"
msgstr "1.1 行程拓樸"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:99 2d9367b141734c5abd29799addd3e110
msgid ""
"Two kinds of process, and one service. The supervisor is a class inside "
"the gateway, not a service of its own."
msgstr "兩種行程，一個服務。監督者是閘道內的一個類別，不是獨立的服務。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:48 c5de3d1f344747e4a906507715c6e07f
msgid "Process"
msgstr "行程"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:48 512b886274494625991d558eaf3aa211
msgid "Owns"
msgstr "擁有什麼"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:48 400700e934164abb874903ca628c5b79
msgid "What its death costs"
msgstr "它死掉的代價"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:48 6240808d5f6a4d2db6c50805ae94cdcb
msgid "**Gateway** (one)"
msgstr "**閘道**（一個）"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:48 646136cd27034374bf01f349bad7267e
msgid ""
"Sockets, correlation ids, backpressure, the event loop, and the "
"`Supervisor` — which holds every `SessionLog` in this process, on the "
"gateway's behalf"
msgstr "連線、關聯代號、背壓、事件迴圈，以及 `Supervisor`——它代表閘道持有這個行程中的每一份 `SessionLog`"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:48 96bbe303b5bc4b72a497f052b94080d5
msgid "Everything. Logs are in memory and are not persisted"
msgstr "一切。日誌存在記憶體中，不會持久化"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:48 45a047fefe2f4d4995c3c46fd62fdd87
msgid "**Worker** (N)"
msgstr "**工作者**（N 個）"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:48 a97d375bdefe4f2f9a3d4fe266e756b6
msgid "QuantLib: sessions, graphs, engines. Shared or sacrificial per §2.1"
msgstr "QuantLib：工作階段、物件圖、引擎。依 §2.1 分為共用或可犧牲"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:48 77e261d9baa6472eb1ab8c72bf647875
msgid "Its sessions replay elsewhere; their in-flight requests are lost"
msgstr "它的工作階段在別處重播；進行中的請求則遺失"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:107 56cd45b3bc8748239abcf9111da3648e
msgid ""
"Three things in the code make the supervisor a component rather than a "
"service, and any attempt to split it out has to deal with all three:"
msgstr "程式碼中有三件事讓監督者成為一個元件而不是一個服務，任何想把它拆出去的嘗試都得同時處理這三件事："

#: ../../DESIGN.md:110 926e0841c3cd45b6aad3473439cde41b
msgid ""
"It is constructed with `FrameSink`, `DisruptionSink` and `DeadlineTimer` "
"— plain callbacks into the gateway, which would become RPCs back to it."
msgstr "它以 `FrameSink`、`DisruptionSink` 與 `DeadlineTimer` 建構——都是回呼閘道的普通回呼函式，拆出去後會變成回頭呼叫閘道的 RPC。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:112 fe70bc2059de4a40a0bfc98c316b9413
msgid ""
"`sessions_` and `workers_` are mutated from six entry points with no "
"mutex, which is sound only because all six are called from the one event "
"loop."
msgstr "`sessions_` 與 `workers_` 由六個進入點修改而沒有互斥鎖，這之所以正確，只因為這六個進入點都從同一個事件迴圈呼叫。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:114 6928deead8ba49b280838b44fc70a3e5
msgid ""
"A `SessionLog` is the gateway's own record of what a client sent. "
"Splitting the supervisor out means either replicating that log across the"
" boundary or serializing every `UpdateMarket` twice."
msgstr "`SessionLog` 是閘道自己對用戶端送了什麼的紀錄。把監督者拆出去，意味著要嘛跨越邊界複製這份日誌，要嘛把每個 `UpdateMarket` 序列化兩次。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:118 3fbce973c4b04a209b8716d7161f685a
msgid ""
"It is still the natural seam if several gateways should ever share one "
"worker fleet: the interface is narrow — open, dispatch, cancel, worker "
"died, request terminated, and three callbacks out. The hard part is not "
"the interface, it is that the session log would need an owner other than "
"the socket that produced it."
msgstr "如果將來有好幾個閘道要共用同一批工作者，這裡仍然是天然的接縫：介面很窄——開啟、派送、取消、工作者死亡、請求終結，再加上三個往外的回呼。難的不是介面，而是工作階段日誌需要一個擁有者，而不是產生它的那條連線。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:124 73eace7863c94a11ad13ad0692ccca06
msgid ""
"**Data plane and control plane leave the gateway by different routes.** "
"`ClientFrame`/`ServerFrame` — the same Protobuf types used on the "
"WebSocket — are forwarded to a worker over its pipe or socket and routed "
"inside it by `session_id`, one `Worker` thread per session. But `spawn`, "
"`kill` and `requestStop` cannot travel that way: a worker deep in a Monte"
" Carlo is not reading its queue, which is exactly the situation a cancel "
"has to interrupt (`worker.cpp`, the `kCancel` case, spells this out). "
"They are process control — fork, signal, or a flag in shared memory — and"
" that is why `ProcessHost` exists as an interface separate from frame "
"delivery."
msgstr "**資料平面與控制平面經由不同的路徑離開閘道。**`ClientFrame`/`ServerFrame`——與 WebSocket 上相同的 Protobuf 型別——經由管道或 socket 轉送給工作者，並在工作者內依 `session_id` 路由，每個工作階段一條 `Worker` 執行緒。但 `spawn`、`kill` 與 `requestStop` 不能走這條路：深陷蒙地卡羅中的工作者不會讀取它的佇列，而這正是取消必須打斷的情況（`worker.cpp` 的 `kCancel` 分支寫明了這一點）。它們屬於行程控制——fork、訊號，或共享記憶體中的旗標——這也是 `ProcessHost` 以獨立於訊框傳遞的介面存在的原因。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:134 b25898770f8b419a94b03315eebcd501
msgid ""
"**Failure domains follow the process boundary, and are deliberately "
"lopsided.** A worker is disposable: whatever kills it, the supervisor "
"replays its sessions into another one and the client keeps its "
"`session_id`. The gateway is not: it holds the only copy of every session"
" definition, so losing it loses every session on the box. That asymmetry "
"is the design working as intended — expensive state where it can be "
"thrown away, cheap state where it cannot — but it does mean the gateway "
"is a single point of failure that nothing here mitigates. What makes that"
" survivable is not in this process at all: the client holds the "
"definition and replays it, which §1.2 sets out."
msgstr "**失效範圍沿著行程邊界劃分，而且刻意不對稱**。工作者是可拋棄的：不管什麼東西殺了它，監督者都會把它的工作階段重播到另一個工作者，而用戶端保有它的 `session_id`。閘道則不然：它持有每個工作階段定義的唯一副本，失去它就失去這台機器上所有的工作階段。這種不對稱正是設計預期的樣子——昂貴的狀態放在可以丟掉的地方，便宜的狀態放在丟不得的地方——但這也確實意味著閘道是單點故障，而這裡沒有任何機制緩解它。讓它撐得過去的東西根本不在這個行程裡：用戶端持有定義並重播它，§1.2 會說明這一點。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:144 32e2f5eb0c094b3aa89941d13e4b5064
msgid "1.2 Where state lives, and what it survives"
msgstr "1.2 狀態存放在哪裡，以及它撐得過什麼"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:146 470aadf0271f45a3a0306fcd5b9a1fd4
msgid ""
"A session is two things kept apart on purpose: a **graph**, which is "
"expensive and derivable, and a **definition**, which is cheap and is not."
" The service owns the first and the client owns the second, and every "
"recovery path in this document falls out of that split."
msgstr "一個工作階段是刻意分開保存的兩樣東西：一份**物件圖**，昂貴但可以推導出來；以及一份**定義**，便宜卻無法推導。服務擁有前者，用戶端擁有後者，而這份文件中的每一條復原路徑都源自這個分工。"

