"optimisation over replay rather than a replacement for it. Replay is the "
"only path that works when the service remembers nothing, and it works "
"because the definition was never the service's to keep."
msgstr "最後兩列正是 §9.4 的接回之所以被描述為重播之上的最佳化、而不是重播替代品的原因。在服務什麼都不記得時，重播是唯一行得通的路徑，而它行得通，是因為定義從來就不歸服務保管。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:183 f9276406020d4f3baf9698a18b07d5d0
msgid "1.3 Scaling out, and what pins a session to one box"
msgstr "1.3 橫向擴展，以及是什麼把工作階段釘在一台機器上"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:185 39363cdd547a49efaeda4f4801933239
msgid ""
"One box is the unit. Within it the design already spreads work — sessions"
" packed into shared workers, long requests sent to sacrificial ones "
"(§2.1). Across boxes it does not spread at all, and §1.2 is the reason: a"
" session is a graph in a worker's memory plus a log in one gateway's, and"
" that pair is reachable only from the process holding it."
msgstr "一台機器是基本單位。在機器之內，設計已經會分散工作——工作階段被塞進共用工作者，長時間的請求送往可犧牲的工作者（§2.1）。跨機器則完全不分散，原因就是 §1.2：工作階段是某個工作者記憶體中的物件圖，加上某一個閘道記憶體中的日誌，而這一對只有持有它的行程才碰得到。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:191 18d2ecba3aa6496496d996d2602202b6
msgid ""
"That rules out the cheap form of horizontal scaling — identical replicas "
"behind a round-robin balancer — and leaves the other one. **Sessions "
"shard; they do not replicate.** A router in front of N gateways must send"
" every frame of a session to the gateway that opened it, which costs "
"almost nothing here: a session lives on one long-lived WebSocket, so "
"connection affinity *is* session affinity, and nothing has to parse a "
"`session_id` out of a Protobuf body to route correctly. `/healthz` (§9.6)"
" is already the liveness signal such a router needs, and is deliberately "
"honest about its scope — it proves the loop is turning, not that any "
"graph is well."
msgstr "這排除了便宜的那種橫向擴展——在輪詢式負載平衡器後面放一排相同的副本——只剩下另一種。**工作階段分片，而不複製**。N 個閘道前面的路由器必須把同一個工作階段的每個訊框都送到開啟它的那個閘道，而這在這裡幾乎沒有成本：工作階段活在一條長期存在的 WebSocket 上，所以連線親和性*就是*工作階段親和性，不需要任何東西從 Protobuf 本體中解析出 `session_id` 才能正確路由。`/healthz`（§9.6）已經是這種路由器需要的存活訊號，而且刻意誠實地標明它的範圍——它證明迴圈在轉，而不是任何物件圖都安好。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:201 e7525599adf2445fb676e4cc35455654
msgid "Four things pin a session to its box. Only the first is trivial to remove:"
msgstr "有四件事把工作階段釘在它的機器上。只有第一件移除起來很簡單："

#: ../../DESIGN.md:48 0871e3dff3a34b85a8d107cbb3d79877
