msgstr "一個不是產生該日誌之連線的日誌擁有者——也就是 §8 的未決問題，以及把監督者拆出去時困難的那一半"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:48 4cfdd4714ae34120a462baedfe1ad6e8
msgid "The resume token and its window are the gateway's"
msgstr "接回權杖與它的寬限期屬於閘道"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:48 a03de637e8c64f34ac8dc8d2a1bc8a98
msgid "§9.4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../DESIGN.md:48 899fb1a2e92248188a25db28ad15727e
msgid "That same owner. A reconnect landing elsewhere is a reopen, not a resume"
msgstr "同一個擁有者。落在別處的重新連線是重新開啟，而不是接回"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:48 8c62a419ecd64d70b718a6af7b13305a
msgid ""
"The supervisor is a class on the gateway's loop: callbacks in, no mutex "
"on `sessions_`"
msgstr "監督者是閘道迴圈上的一個類別：回呼進來，`sessions_` 上沒有互斥鎖"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:48 b5a7769eacfe4a65bc7f970c2dec666f
msgid "§1.1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../DESIGN.md:48 5cd5c8620ab940a3b01a85dafdb1ec14
msgid "Turning those callbacks into RPCs, which §1.1 already names as the seam"
msgstr "把那些回呼改成 RPC，§1.1 已經指出這就是接縫"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:210 dc4c5cd7d9384aa6ac75dedee3718499
msgid ""
"**Decision: none of this is built, and the client-held definition is why "
"it does not block.** Replay is the failover path (§1.2). A gateway lost "
"to a crash or a deploy costs its clients the work in flight and one round"
" trip rather than recoverable state, because the document never left the "
"browser and a rebuild is 0.009 ms for the seven-object market the "
"[handlers page](HANDLERS.md) opens with and 3.6 ms for a curve stripped "
"from forty-eight swap pillars (§9.4). Sharding by connection therefore "
"needs the id fix and nothing else; failing a session *over* to another "
"box needs the log to have an owner, and that earns its complexity only "
"once one gateway's core count is the binding constraint rather than its "
"liveness."
msgstr "**決定：以上都沒有實作，而用戶端持有定義正是它不構成阻礙的原因**。重播就是容錯移轉的路徑（§1.2）。因當機或部署而失去的閘道，讓它的用戶端損失的是進行中的工作與一次往返，而不是可復原的狀態，因為文件從未離開瀏覽器，而重建對[處理常式頁面](HANDLERS.md)開頭那個七個物件的市場只要 0.009 ms，對一條由四十八個交換節點拔靴出來的曲線也只要 3.6 ms（§9.4）。因此依連線分片只需要修正代號，其他什麼都不用；要把工作階段*容錯移轉*到另一台機器，則需要日誌有一個擁有者，而只有當單一閘道的核心數、而不是它的存活，成為真正的瓶頸時，這份複雜度才值得。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:221 a8dd7d57ff7146c793858b87f5b63774
msgid ""
"**What the statefulness actually buys, which is what should decide the "
"shape.** It is not bootstrap amortisation: §9.4 measured that at single-"
"digit milliseconds, which is exactly why the resume window there is "
"justified by the work in flight instead. It is the observer graph of §5 —"
" a quote write invalidates only the instruments depending on it, so a "
"slider drag recomputes a subgraph rather than a market. A load that is "
"mostly one-shot pricing would scale more simply as stateless replicas and"
" would lose little by it; this design earns its constraints when a client"
" is dragging a spot and expecting the panel to keep up."
msgstr "**有狀態實際換來的是什麼，而這才應該決定形狀**。不是攤提拔靴成本：§9.4 量到那只是個位數毫秒，這也正是那裡的接回寬限期改以進行中的工作作為理由的原因。換來的是 §5 的觀察者物件圖——寫入一個報價只會讓依賴它的金融工具失效，所以拖動滑桿時重算的是一個子圖，而不是整個市場。若負載大多是一次性定價，以無狀態副本擴展會更簡單，也幾乎沒有損失；這個設計的種種限制，是在用戶端拖動現貨價格並期待面板跟得上時才值回票價。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:231 bed86bcdc5f14852bf21948c20067e79
msgid "2. Global state forces session pinning"
msgstr "2. 全域狀態迫使工作階段固定"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:233 499822e2dcb84d02bef05a20611b90ca
msgid ""
"Every singleton in QuantLib is session-local; none is declared `Global = "
"true`: `Settings`, `IndexManager`, `ObservableSettings`, "
"`LazyObject::Defaults`, `SeedGenerator`, `ExchangeRateManager`, "
"`Money::Settings`, `IborCoupon::Settings`, `Tracing`."
msgstr "QuantLib 中的每一個單例都是工作階段區域的；沒有一個宣告為 `Global = true`：`Settings`、`IndexManager`、`ObservableSettings`、`LazyObject::Defaults`、`SeedGenerator`、`ExchangeRateManager`、`Money::Settings`、`IborCoupon::Settings`、`Tracing`。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:238 fb680ce46d6c4c8ab26762a0e4978f56
msgid ""
"In a default build `Singleton<T>::instance()` returns one process-wide "
"static (`ql/patterns/singleton.hpp:104`). Two concurrent requests that "
"each set `Settings::evaluationDate()` corrupt each other silently — "
"plausible numbers, wrong date."
msgstr "在預設建置中，`Singleton<T>::instance()` 回傳一個整個行程共用的靜態實例（`ql/patterns/singleton.hpp:104`）。兩個各自設定 `Settings::evaluationDate()` 的並行請求會悄悄地互相破壞——數字看起來合理，日期卻是錯的。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:243 6e1eba5b74a54def905849e8d3f8c9e2
msgid ""
"**Decision: build workers with `QL_ENABLE_SESSIONS`** (`--enable-"
"sessions`). `instance()` then returns a `thread_local` instance "
"(`ql/patterns/singleton.hpp:92`), giving each worker thread an "
"independent QuantLib world. Note this is automatic in current QuantLib — "
"there is no user-supplied `sessionId()` function, contrary to older "
"documentation."
msgstr "**決定：以 `QL_ENABLE_SESSIONS` 建置工作者**（`--enable-sessions`）。此時 `instance()` 回傳一個 `thread_local` 實例（`ql/patterns/singleton.hpp:92`），讓每條工作者執行緒擁有獨立的 QuantLib 世界。注意在目前的 QuantLib 中這是自動的——與較舊的文件所說的相反，並不需要使用者提供 `sessionId()` 函式。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:249 4e07b7f8b96441ae9fd6174efb9ea9ee
msgid ""
"**Decision: pin one client session to one worker thread for its whole "
"life.** An object graph built on thread A must never be priced on thread "
"B; handles and the observer graph are shared mutable state that sessions "
"do not protect."
msgstr "**決定：一個用戶端工作階段在整個生命週期中都固定在一條工作者執行緒上**。在執行緒 A 上建構的物件圖絕不能在執行緒 B 上定價；handle 與觀察者物件圖是共享的可變狀態，工作階段機制並不保護它們。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:253 7818f85788e149a4aa6936ec31ff8a8d
msgid ""
"Sharing one bootstrapped curve across sessions would require "
"`QL_ENABLE_THREAD_SAFE_OBSERVER_PATTERN` — Boost.Signals2 over a "
"`recursive_mutex` (`ql/patterns/observable.cpp:104`), described as \"less"
" performant\" in `Docs/pages/config.docs:83`. We pay duplicate bootstrap "
"cost per session instead and keep the fast observer."
msgstr "要在工作階段之間共用同一條拔靴好的曲線，就需要 `QL_ENABLE_THREAD_SAFE_OBSERVER_PATTERN`——以 `recursive_mutex` 為基礎的 Boost.Signals2（`ql/patterns/observable.cpp:104`），在 `Docs/pages/config.docs:83` 中被形容為「效能較差」。我們選擇讓每個工作階段重複付出拔靴成本，保留快速的觀察者。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:259 76f6a1da145a43e1995eef0c5cc9acf4
msgid "2.1 How many sessions per process"
msgstr "2.1 每個行程放幾個工作階段"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:261 a88e4cbf806146d090fac8f57989d982
msgid ""
"One session to one thread is forced by QuantLib. One session to one "
"*process* is not — that comes only from the cancellation design in §3, "
"and the two choices have to be made together."
msgstr "一個工作階段對一條執行緒是 QuantLib 強制的。一個工作階段對一個*行程*則不是——那只來自 §3 的取消設計，而這兩個選擇必須一起做。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:48 6d0ff94fc3a045eb87156935f83d1dd4
msgid "Isolation"
msgstr "隔離"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:48 46f17fd72f0b4de8b9053cb8636a8d78
