#: ../../DESIGN.md:271 5e437fcca6c743ea9d9f1c865cd69fd1
msgid ""
"Under B, killing a worker to serve one `CancelRequest` destroys every "
"other session sharing that process. What makes that survivable is that "
"**session state is derivable**: `OpenSession` plus the `UpdateMarket` "
"frames that followed it fully determine the object graph, and that is a "
"few kilobytes the gateway already has. A killed session is replayed into "
"a fresh worker and keeps its `session_id`, so the client is not told it "
"moved. What cannot be recovered is the work that was in flight: requests "
"on a killed process never produce a terminal frame, so the supervisor "
"reports each affected session and the gateway fails their outstanding ids"
" with `WORKER_DIED`. A kill therefore costs one bootstrap and the "
"requests running at the time, not the session."
msgstr "在 B 之下，為了服務一個 `CancelRequest` 而 kill 工作者，會摧毀共用該行程的其他所有工作階段。讓這件事撐得過去的是**工作階段狀態可以推導**：`OpenSession` 加上其後的 `UpdateMarket` 訊框完全決定了物件圖，而那只是閘道本來就有的幾 KB。被 kill 的工作階段會重播到一個新的工作者中並保有它的 `session_id`，所以用戶端不會被告知它搬了家。無法復原的是當時進行中的工作：被 kill 的行程上的請求永遠不會產生終結訊框，所以監督者會回報每個受影響的工作階段，由閘道以 `WORKER_DIED` 讓它們未結束的代號失敗。因此一次 kill 的代價是一次拔靴加上當時正在執行的請求，而不是整個工作階段。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:282 9413eee515de4a0e9403bd8a866caa8b
msgid ""
"Three requirements fall out of replay and cancel, and they are protocol "
"obligations rather than implementation details:"
msgstr "重播與取消衍生出三項要求，它們是協定上的義務，而不是實作細節："

#: ../../DESIGN.md:285 4b0d850866a845a38f69aeb17227d417
msgid ""
"The gateway retains each session's definition as an ordered log. It "
"compacts trivially: a later `QuoteUpdate` supersedes an earlier one for "
"the same `quote_id`, so the log stays at `OpenSession` plus one entry per"
" distinct quote no matter how long the user tweaks."
msgstr "閘道把每個工作階段的定義保留為一份有序日誌。它很容易壓縮：較晚的 `QuoteUpdate` 會取代同一個 `quote_id` 較早的那筆，所以不管使用者調整多久，日誌都維持在 `OpenSession` 加上每個不同報價一筆。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:289 47c77dac37f24e92b07712bce601f7df
msgid ""
"Replay must reach the same graph, so nothing that affects pricing may "
"enter the worker outside these frames — no worker-local clock reads, no "
"`Settings::evaluationDate()` set from anything but `OpenSession`. A "
"session whose result depends on when it ran cannot be replayed."
msgstr "重播必須得到相同的物件圖，所以任何會影響定價的東西都不得經由這些訊框以外的途徑進入工作者——不讀工作者本地的時鐘，`Settings::evaluationDate()` 只能由 `OpenSession` 設定。結果取決於執行時間的工作階段是無法重播的。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:293 3f8bcd2d1e6846028072da2bd335212d
msgid ""
"The gateway reports every terminal frame it forwards back to the "
"supervisor, through `onRequestTerminated()`, and hands it the whole frame"
" rather than just its id. Two things ride on the outcome. A cancel target"
" that stopped politely inside its grace is otherwise indistinguishable "
"from one still running, so every cancel would cost a kill and a replay "
"that were not needed. And an `UpdateMarket` is folded into the session "
"log only when it comes back as an `Ack`: that is the sole path by which "
"the log advances past `OpenSession`, so without it a replay would "
"silently restore the session to the market data it opened with — the "
"quiet failure this whole section exists to prevent. A write that comes "
"back as an `Error`, or that dies with its worker before answering, is "
"dropped, which keeps the log a description of what the worker actually "
"holds."
msgstr "閘道會透過 `onRequestTerminated()` 把它轉送的每一個終結訊框回報給監督者，而且交出的是整個訊框，不只是它的代號。有兩件事取決於這個結果。第一，在寬限期內客氣停下的取消目標，否則無法與仍在執行的請求區分，於是每次取消都得付出其實不需要的 kill 與重播。第二，`UpdateMarket` 只有在以 `Ack` 回來時才會併入工作階段日誌：那是日誌推進到 `OpenSession` 之後的唯一途徑，少了它，重播就會悄悄把工作階段恢復成開啟時的市場資料——正是這整節要防止的那種無聲失敗。以 `Error` 回來、或在回應之前就隨工作者一起死掉的寫入會被丟棄，這讓日誌始終描述工作者實際持有的內容。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:306 9ffa90aa715348169b2cf77a848be222
msgid ""
"**Decision: configuration C.** Cheap interactive work — a quote bump on a"
" live graph, sub-second — runs in shared multi-threaded workers. Anything"
" cancellable and long, meaning Monte Carlo and calibration, is dispatched"
" to a single-session process that can be killed freely. Process-per-"
"session is then paid only for the calculations that need it."
msgstr "**決定：採用配置 C**。便宜的互動工作——在即時物件圖上調動報價，一秒以內——在共用的多執行緒工作者中執行。任何可取消又耗時的工作，也就是蒙地卡羅與校準，則派送到可以隨意 kill 的單一工作階段行程。這樣，每個工作階段一個行程的代價，只由真正需要它的計算來付。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:312 7ef021a3f77a48218a1e0ea2d7a4c4f2
msgid ""
"Isolation is what makes the kill affordable, and the kill is what a "
"cancel comes down to for any request that is a single engine call. The "
"polite stop in §3 covers the three shapes with a loop of our own to check"
" a flag in — a batched Monte Carlo, a sweep and a batch — and cannot "
"touch the rest. Sizing the grace short is therefore right: on everything "
"else it is pure added latency before the kill that was always going to "
"happen."
msgstr "隔離讓 kill 負擔得起，而對任何只是單一引擎呼叫的請求而言，取消歸根究柢就是 kill。§3 的客氣停止涵蓋三種形狀，它們都有我們自己寫的迴圈可以檢查旗標——批次化的蒙地卡羅、掃描與批次——其餘則完全碰不到。因此把寬限期設短是對的：對其他所有請求而言，它純粹是在注定發生的 kill 之前多加的延遲。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:319 d81f3fc5836b4526abed239efdc43777
msgid ""
"**Placement is a property of the request, not of the session.** A session"
" opens in the shared pool and moves when `placementFor()` disagrees with "
"where it is: a `CloseSession` on the old worker and a replay into the new"
" one, never a migration, because the graph is thread-bound and cannot be "
"handed over — and never a kill either, because the process it is leaving "
"is probably hosting other sessions. A panel that alternates an analytic "
"price with a Monte Carlo on the same session pays that bootstrap in each "
"direction, so requests of one kind belong on a session of their own. The "
"engine method is a crude proxy for \"long\" — a 200-path Monte Carlo is "
"cheap and a large FD grid is not — and a sample count or a client-"
"declared budget would be the better signal (§8)."
msgstr "**安置是請求的屬性，而不是工作階段的屬性**。工作階段在共用池中開啟，當 `placementFor()` 與它所在的位置不一致時就搬移：在舊工作者上 `CloseSession`，再重播到新工作者，絕不是遷移，因為物件圖綁定在執行緒上，無法交接——也絕不是 kill，因為它要離開的行程多半還承載著其他工作階段。在同一個工作階段上交替進行解析定價與蒙地卡羅的面板，每換一個方向就要付一次拔靴，所以同一類的請求應該放在各自的工作階段上。引擎方法只是「耗時」的粗略代理——200 條路徑的蒙地卡羅很便宜，大型有限差分網格則不然——樣本數或用戶端宣告的預算會是更好的訊號（§8）。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:331 cdc2a88840fe48cea2d41b3503ae42d8
msgid ""
"**The packing is the supervisor's, not the process host's.** The host "
"starts, feeds and stops processes and decides nothing; which shared "
"worker takes the next session is policy, and it lives beside the "
"placement rule so both can be tested against a fake host. A session takes"
" a seat on the first shared worker with room — "
"`Options::sessionsPerSharedWorker`, 8 by default — and forks only when "
"none has any. Since one session is one thread, that knob is a thread "
"count per process, and what it bounds is the blast radius of a kill on a "
"shared worker: how many co-tenants a cancel that goes the hard way takes "
"with it. It does not bound concurrency. A session that finds every shared"
" worker full gets a fresh one, so threads on the box follow sessions "
"open; capping the pool and queueing sessions on it is §8. A process is "
"retired once its last session leaves, so process count tracks live "
"sessions rather than their high-water mark."
msgstr "**打包是監督者的事，不是行程宿主的事**。宿主負責啟動、餵送與停止行程，不做任何決定；下一個工作階段由哪個共用工作者承接是策略，它與安置規則放在一起，兩者都能對著假的宿主測試。工作階段在第一個還有空位的共用工作者上取得座位——`Options::sessionsPerSharedWorker`，預設為 8——只有在都沒有空位時才 fork。由於一個工作階段就是一條執行緒，這個旋鈕就是每個行程的執行緒數，而它限制的是在共用工作者上 kill 的波及範圍：一次走到強硬手段的取消會連帶拖走多少同住者。它並不限制並行度。發現所有共用工作者都滿了的工作階段會得到一個新的工作者，所以機器上的執行緒數跟著開啟的工作階段數走；為共用池設上限、讓工作階段在它前面排隊，屬於 §8。行程在最後一個工作階段離開後就退役，所以行程數追蹤的是現存的工作階段，而不是它們的歷史高點。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:345 bc2fa48dd6764bf8bc4588953ae98192
msgid "The shape that falls out:"
msgstr "由此得出的形狀："

#: ../../DESIGN.md:377 d0f667dba7064a499713d9e19f9669fb
msgid ""
"The supervisor packs: a second shared process is forked only once this "
"one has no room, and the sacrificial process is killed to serve a cancel "
"and replayed afterwards. The ratios worth holding in mind:"
msgstr "監督者會打包：只有當這個共用行程沒有空位時，才 fork 第二個；可犧牲的行程則為了服務取消而被 kill，之後再重播。值得記住的比例："

#: ../../DESIGN.md:347 2753282cbed34679bad94f474c60f1d8
msgid "Relationship"
msgstr "關係"

