msgstr "這正是讓 kill 負擔得起的原因"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:388 efdafdb572ef4968babec4f46081b48f
msgid ""
"Threads in a process therefore equal the sessions it holds: a shared "
"worker is multi-threaded because it hosts many sessions, never because "
"one session uses many threads."
msgstr "因此一個行程中的執行緒數等於它持有的工作階段數：共用工作者之所以是多執行緒的，是因為它承載許多工作階段，絕不是因為某個工作階段使用了多條執行緒。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:392 5f722f5dcaf841e1a2dfb8b9d63d91df
msgid ""
"D is the same session as before its Monte Carlo: it left the shared "
"worker on a `CloseSession`, replayed into a process of its own, and goes "
"back to the pool on its next analytic price. Placement follows the "
"request."
msgstr "D 與它做蒙地卡羅之前是同一個工作階段：它以 `CloseSession` 離開共用工作者，重播進一個自己的行程，並在下一次解析定價時回到共用池。安置跟著請求走。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:396 73565dd194e14435897767d57a3598b2
msgid ""
"**Consequence for the frontend: within a session, everything "
"serializes.** Two price requests on one graph cannot overlap — not even "
"nominally read-only ones, because `NPV()` writes to the lazy cache as it "
"computes (`ql/patterns/lazyobject.hpp`). A 100-strike smile is therefore "
"N sessions each holding its own copy of the graph, or a sequential loop; "
"it is never one session with N threads. Panels that fan out plots drive "
"pool sizing directly."
msgstr "**對前端的影響：在一個工作階段內，一切都序列化**。同一個物件圖上的兩個定價請求不能重疊——即使名義上是唯讀的也不行，因為 `NPV()` 在計算時會寫入惰性快取（`ql/patterns/lazyobject.hpp`）。因此一條 100 個履約價的微笑曲線，要嘛是 N 個各自持有物件圖副本的工作階段，要嘛是一個循序的迴圈；絕不會是一個工作階段配 N 條執行緒。會展開多張圖的面板直接決定了池的大小。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:403 4b0233ffaffe4b95b3454b772b55d62b
msgid "2.2 QuantLib does not parallelise for you"
msgstr "2.2 QuantLib 不會替你平行化"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:405 471220f54dbb41d689059535b642fd10
msgid ""
"Worth stating plainly before anyone sizes a pool on the assumption that a"
" single price uses more than one core: it does not. There is no TBB, no "
"thread pool, and no `std::thread`, `std::async` or `std::future` anywhere"
" in `ql/`."
msgstr "在任何人以「一次定價會用到不只一個核心」為前提來規劃池的大小之前，值得先講清楚：不會。`ql/` 裡沒有 TBB、沒有執行緒池，任何地方都沒有 `std::thread`、`std::async` 或 `std::future`。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:409 dad066c560c3436aadb6e1d1547a4bce
msgid ""
"Internal parallelism is four OpenMP pragmas, all off in a stock build "
"(`QL_ENABLE_OPENMP` defaults to `OFF` at `CMakeLists.txt:45`; `--enable-"
"openmp` at `configure.ac:57`):"
msgstr "內部的平行化只有四個 OpenMP pragma，在標準建置中全部關閉（`QL_ENABLE_OPENMP` 在 `CMakeLists.txt:45` 預設為 `OFF`；`configure.ac:57` 中為 `--enable-openmp`）："

#: ../../DESIGN.md:413 9796d94ef0a04f1f9f1573b411c3b09d
msgid ""
"`ql/methods/lattices/lattice.hpp:173` — tree rollback, guarded "
"`if(size(i) >= 1024)` so early sparse steps do not pay for a thread team"
msgstr "`ql/methods/lattices/lattice.hpp:173`——樹狀回推，以 `if(size(i) >= 1024)` 保護，讓前面稀疏的步驟不必為一組執行緒付出代價"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:415 f7282604ac5e4520beb0db176b6aeb45
msgid "`ql/pricingengines/swaption/gaussian1dswaptionengine.cpp:136`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../DESIGN.md:416 a67cdf0c76ce4ed5962c52773a202fde
msgid ""
"`ql/termstructures/volatility/zabrsmilesection.hpp:217` — ZABR full-FD "
"prices across strikes"
msgstr "`ql/termstructures/volatility/zabrsmilesection.hpp:217`——ZABR 完整有限差分在各履約價上的定價"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:418 07085992da344f3bbc9d18e75da4ddbe
msgid "`ql/methods/finitedifferences/operators/triplebandlinearop.cpp:199`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../DESIGN.md:420 dce571f4d622486697fb046701c603af
msgid ""
"A dozen further pragmas in `triplebandlinearop.cpp` and "
"`ninepointlinearop.cpp` are commented out, which says the FD operators "
"were tried and abandoned. Monte Carlo — where parallelism would be most "
"natural, and where this service spends its longest calculations — has "
"none at all: `McSimulation` walks its samples in a plain loop."
msgstr "`triplebandlinearop.cpp` 與 `ninepointlinearop.cpp` 中另有十幾個 pragma 被註解掉，這表示有限差分運算子曾經嘗試過平行化，後來放棄了。蒙地卡羅——平行化最自然、也是這個服務花最長時間計算的地方——完全沒有：`McSimulation` 用一個普通的迴圈走過它的樣本。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:426 20d0b9dde3ce4bb58925cc73eb8d29ff
msgid ""
"The comment above the Gaussian1d pragma is the library authors stating "
"this design's central constraint in their own words "
"(`gaussian1dswaptionengine.cpp:107-111`):"
msgstr "Gaussian1d pragma 上方的註解，是函式庫作者用他們自己的話說出這個設計的核心限制（`gaussian1dswaptionengine.cpp:107-111`）："

#: ../../DESIGN.md:430 d1def2200a594d8799aaa8d4eccf2678
msgid ""
"a lazy object is not thread safe, neither is the caching in gsrprocess. "
"therefore we trigger computations here such that neither lazy object "
"recalculation nor write access during caching occurs in the parallized "
"loop below."
msgstr "惰性物件不是執行緒安全的，gsrprocess 中的快取也不是。因此我們在這裡先觸發計算，讓下方平行化的迴圈中既不會發生惰性物件的重算，也不會在快取時發生寫入存取。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:435 0ca8ab55bc394ef69926606e5ae12e7f
msgid ""
"They pre-warm `yGrid`, `forwardRate`, `zerobond` and `numeraire` inside "
"an `#ifdef _OPENMP` block before entering the loop, precisely so that no "
"`LazyObject` recalculates inside it. That is the price of parallelising "
"anything that touches the graph, and it is why so little of the library "
"does."
msgstr "他們在進入迴圈之前，於一個 `#ifdef _OPENMP` 區塊中預先暖好 `yGrid`、`forwardRate`、`zerobond` 與 `numeraire`，就是為了讓迴圈內沒有任何 `LazyObject` 重算。這是把任何碰到物件圖的東西平行化的代價，也是函式庫中這麼少地方這樣做的原因。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:440 afd38ea17f244dc68671d0f6997ffc88
msgid ""
"**Decision: workers are built without OpenMP.** Under configuration C "
"every session-thread in a shared worker would spawn its own thread team, "
"oversubscribe the cores, and compete with the pool that is already "
"providing the concurrency. If a lattice- or FD-heavy workload ever "
"justifies it, it belongs only on the sacrificial single-session "
"processes, with `OMP_NUM_THREADS` pinned — never in the shared pool."
msgstr "**決定：工作者建置時不啟用 OpenMP**。在配置 C 之下，共用工作者中的每條工作階段執行緒都會生出自己的一組執行緒，超額使用核心，並與已經在提供並行度的池互相競爭。如果將來有以格點或有限差分為主的工作負載值得這麼做，它也只屬於可犧牲的單一工作階段行程，並固定 `OMP_NUM_THREADS`——絕不放在共用池中。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:447 5aa31180613b45e3a022ee8bb2eecfd5
msgid ""
"Supporting evidence that this is the right shape: QuantLib's own tooling "
"parallelises with processes rather than threads. `quantlib-benchmark` "
"takes `--nProc=16` and fans out over Boost.Process with an interprocess "
"message queue (`test-suite/quantlibbenchmark.cpp:26-53`), and the "
"parallel unit-test runner does the same. The supervisor in §2.1 arrives "
"at the same answer for the same reason."
msgstr "佐證這是正確形狀的證據：QuantLib 自己的工具是以行程而非執行緒來平行化。`quantlib-benchmark` 接受 `--nProc=16`，並透過 Boost.Process 與行程間訊息佇列展開（`test-suite/quantlibbenchmark.cpp:26-53`），平行的單元測試執行器也是如此。§2.1 的監督者基於同樣的理由得出了同樣的答案。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:454 3ac32af345de40d687eeee1be37a007a
msgid "3. No cancellation — hence processes, not threads"
msgstr "3. 沒有取消——所以用行程，而不是執行緒"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:456 fb02778d567d48a4b295acc20650463f
msgid ""
"QuantLib exposes no progress, interrupt, or cancel hook: there is none in"
" `ql/methods/montecarlo/` or `ql/pricingengines/mcsimulation.hpp`. A "
"single engine call runs to completion and cannot be stopped from inside. "
"Everything below follows from that, including the three exceptions — they"
" are ours, not QuantLib's, and they exist only where this service drives "
"the engine in a loop it wrote."
msgstr "QuantLib 沒有提供任何進度、中斷或取消的掛鉤：`ql/methods/montecarlo/` 或 `ql/pricingengines/mcsimulation.hpp` 中都沒有。單一的引擎呼叫會一路跑到完成，無法從內部停下。以下的一切都由此而來，包括那三個例外——它們是我們的，不是 QuantLib 的，而且只存在於這個服務以自己寫的迴圈驅動引擎的地方。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:463 65c1a0df596146f38c06242bab071a1f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Decision: workers are processes, supervised.** `CancelRequest` first "
"asks the worker to stop at its next step and gives it a short grace (250 "
"ms by default). When the grace expires with the request still running, "
"the worker is killed and respawned. Either half terminates the "
"outstanding `request_id` with `Error{code: CANCELLED}` — exactly once, "
"which is why the gateway reports terminal frames back to the supervisor —"
" and the killing half then replays the session definition into a fresh "
"worker per §2.1, so the `session_id` stays valid and the client sees "
"latency rather than loss."
msgstr "**決定：工作者是受監督的行程。**`CancelRequest` 先要求工作者在下一步停下，並給它一段短暫的寬限期（預設 250 ms）。當寬限期到了而請求仍在執行，工作者就會被 kill 並重新產生。兩個半段都會以 `Error{code: CANCELLED}` 終結未結束的 `request_id`——恰好一次，這正是閘道要把終結訊框回報給監督者的原因——而 kill 的那一半接著依 §2.1 把工作階段定義重播到新的工作者中，所以 `session_id` 仍然有效，用戶端看到的是延遲，而不是損失。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:472 d1d7d3da396a48e69ca6ef03e68a352c
msgid ""
"**Which requests can take the grace, and what it means that the rest "
"cannot.** This section long said a batched Monte Carlo could stop "
"politely and nothing else could. Three shapes can, and they are the three"
" that have an *outer* loop this service wrote: a batched Monte Carlo "
"between path batches, a scenario sweep between points, and a `PriceBatch`"
" between entries. Each checks the stop flag, keeps what it computed, and "
"answers with a partial result rather than nothing. Everything else is one"
" engine call with no seam to check a flag in, and there the kill is the "
"whole mechanism."
msgstr "**哪些請求能用上寬限期，以及其餘請求用不上意味著什麼**。這一節長久以來都說只有批次化的蒙地卡羅能客氣地停下，其他都不行。實際上有三種形狀可以，而它們正是擁有這個服務自己寫的*外層*迴圈的三種：在路徑批次之間的批次化蒙地卡羅、在情境點之間的情境掃描，以及在項目之間的 `PriceBatch`。每一種都會檢查停止旗標、保留已經算出的部分，並以部分結果而非空無一物回應。其他一切都是單一引擎呼叫，沒有可以檢查旗標的接縫，在那裡 kill 就是全部的機制。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:481 6df618d8fb7645e9abd4ad0df8c7a1c6
msgid ""
"That distinction is worth stating positively, because stating it "
"negatively is what misled the frontend for a milestone: **every request "
"is cancellable**, and what differs is the cost — the three shapes above "
"give the session back with their partial results, and everything else "
"gives the session back after a rebuild. A client that reads \"cannot be "
"interrupted\" as \"cannot be cancelled\" will offer a stop button on a "
"third of its requests, which is what happened."
msgstr "這個區別值得正面陳述，因為反面陳述正是讓前端被誤導了一整個里程碑的原因：**每個請求都可以取消**，差別在於代價——上面三種形狀會帶著部分結果把工作階段交回，其他一切則在重建之後把工作階段交回。把「無法中斷」讀成「無法取消」的用戶端，只會在三分之一的請求上提供停止按鈕，而事情就是這樣發生的。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:488 3792ee1f8d0f45af87e7b5de55be0983
msgid ""
"**What actually runs is a thread host, and it cannot honour a kill.** "
"`ThreadProcessHost` (`src/gateway/threadhost.hpp`) runs workers as thread"
" groups in the gateway process, so everything above except process "
"control is exercised end to end in one binary. Its `kill()` is a "
"*disown*: it asks the worker to stop, drops every frame the seat emits "
"afterwards, and detaches the thread, which runs its Monte Carlo to "
"completion against nothing while the supervisor replays the session "
"elsewhere. The client sees the designed behaviour — one `CANCELLED`, a "
"live `session_id`, a rebuilt graph — and the machine keeps burning a core"
" until the abandoned call finishes. The decision above stands; a fork-"
"based host is what makes it real, and it is the one piece of this design "
"that is specified and not yet built."
msgstr "**實際執行的是執行緒宿主，而它無法兌現 kill。**`ThreadProcessHost`（`src/gateway/threadhost.hpp`）把工作者當成閘道行程中的執行緒群組來執行，所以上述一切除了行程控制之外，都能在單一執行檔中端到端地演練。它的 `kill()` 是一次*棄置*：它要求工作者停下，丟掉該座位之後送出的每一個訊框，並分離那條執行緒，讓它對著空無把蒙地卡羅跑完，同時監督者在別處重播工作階段。用戶端看到的是設計中的行為——一次 `CANCELLED`、仍然有效的 `session_id`、重建好的物件圖——而機器則持續燒掉一個核心，直到被拋棄的呼叫結束。上面的決定仍然成立；讓它成真的是以 fork 為基礎的宿主，而這是本設計中唯一已經定出規格卻尚未實作的部分。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:500 45b7804dcd19490dba164b4f90c2a7de
msgid ""
"**Decision: progress is opt-in and computed by us.** A `PriceRequest` may"
" set `engine.mc.progress_every_paths` — on the Monte Carlo parameter "
"block, because it changes the answer and belongs beside the seed and the "
"sample count that determine it; the worker then runs Monte Carlo in path "
"batches and accumulates on our side, emitting `Progress` frames between "
"batches. Without that field the engine is called once and only a terminal"
" frame is sent. The protocol must not promise progress QuantLib cannot "
"supply."
msgstr "**決定：進度是選用的，並由我們自己計算。**`PriceRequest` 可以設定 `engine.mc.progress_every_paths`——放在蒙地卡羅參數區塊中，因為它會改變答案，應該與決定答案的種子和樣本數放在一起；此時工作者會以路徑批次執行蒙地卡羅並在我們這一側累加，於批次之間送出 `Progress` 訊框。沒有這個欄位時，引擎只呼叫一次，也只送出終結訊框。協定不得承諾 QuantLib 無法提供的進度。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:508 3305087ec31a421aae4fa80a8e182713
msgid "4. Determinism is not free"
msgstr "4. 決定性不是免費的"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:510 8e46408ba867421c9ae2faeaab3d77fa
msgid ""
"`SeedGenerator` seeds from `std::time(nullptr)` "
"(`ql/math/randomnumbers/seedgenerator.cpp:36`). Identical inputs "
"submitted twice return different Monte Carlo prices, which users read as "
"a bug."
msgstr "`SeedGenerator` 以 `std::time(nullptr)` 作為種子（`ql/math/randomnumbers/seedgenerator.cpp:36`）。相同的輸入送兩次會得到不同的蒙地卡羅價格，而使用者會把這當成錯誤。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:514 5209d7aa9452413d868daf473e0b0e5e
msgid ""
"**Decision: `seed` is a required field on any Monte Carlo request** and "
"is echoed in `PriceResult`. The frontend keeps it stable across what-if "
"tweaks so the user sees the effect of the input, not of the RNG, and "
"varies it explicitly when it wants an error estimate."
msgstr "**決定：`seed` 是任何蒙地卡羅請求的必填欄位**，並在 `PriceResult` 中回傳。前端在各種假設情境的調整之間保持它不變，讓使用者看到的是輸入的效果，而不是亂數產生器的效果；需要誤差估計時才明確地改變它。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:519 f06ab69779b64f75b91cc72c00d7d80b
msgid ""
"**Progress changes the number, so it is part of the key.** QuantLib "
"cannot resume an engine, so `progress_every_paths` makes the worker run "
"independent batches with seeds derived from the request seed and average "
"their means. That estimates the same quantity, but it partitions the RNG "
"stream differently from one run of the same total: the batched price and "
"the single-shot price at the same seed do not agree. Reproducibility "
"therefore keys on `(seed, samples, progress_every_paths)`. `PriceResult` "
"echoes the whole `Engine` message rather than three named copies of it, "
"so the promise cannot fall behind the schema the way three hand-"
"maintained fields would. A user who turns a progress bar on must not be "
"told the price moved."
msgstr "**進度會改變數字，所以它是鍵的一部分**。QuantLib 無法接續執行引擎，所以 `progress_every_paths` 會讓工作者以從請求種子衍生出的種子執行彼此獨立的批次，再平均它們的平均值。這估計的是同一個量，但它切分亂數流的方式與同樣總數的單次執行不同：同一個種子下，批次化的價格與單次的價格並不一致。因此可重現性以 `(seed, samples, progress_every_paths)` 為鍵。`PriceResult` 回傳整個 `Engine` 訊息，而不是它的三個具名副本，所以這個承諾不會像三個手動維護的欄位那樣落後於結構描述。一個打開進度條的使用者，不能被告知價格變了。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:529 c5c3bdf64ff341639d15ef9cb216fdbf
msgid "5. The lazy graph is why the backend is stateful"
msgstr "5. 惰性物件圖是後端有狀態的原因"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:531 8308d292d7594a0bacfa704ed790e5db
msgid ""
"This is the actual justification for WebSocket over REST. A session keeps"
" its object graph alive; a what-if from the UI is a "
"`SimpleQuote::setValue()` or a `RelinkableHandle` relink, and the "
"observer graph invalidates exactly the affected instruments — the next "
"`NPV()` recomputes only those. A stateless design rebuilds curves on "
"every request and discards all of it."
msgstr "這才是選擇 WebSocket 而非 REST 的真正理由。工作階段讓它的物件圖保持存活；來自介面的假設情境就是一次 `SimpleQuote::setValue()` 或一次 `RelinkableHandle` 重新連結，而觀察者物件圖只讓受影響的金融工具失效——下一次 `NPV()` 只重算那些。無狀態的設計在每個請求上都重建曲線，然後全部丟掉。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:537 1c64e67669944f41baf9340f63066d16
msgid "Two rules this imposes on the code behind the protocol:"
msgstr "這對協定背後的程式碼施加了兩條規則："

#: ../../DESIGN.md:539 12ea7f6134084a478a41e4175f33ce89
msgid ""
"**Anything the frontend can vary must reach the pricer as an observable**"
" — a `Handle<Quote>` the instrument registered with, never a value copied"
" at construction. Otherwise the slider moves and the price does not "
"(`AGENTS.md` §5.2). Every field in `UpdateMarket` maps to a registered "
"`SimpleQuote`."
msgstr "**前端能變動的任何東西，都必須以可觀察物件的形式到達定價器**——一個金融工具有註冊的 `Handle<Quote>`，絕不是建構時複製的值。否則滑桿動了，價格卻不動（`AGENTS.md` §5.2）。`UpdateMarket` 中的每一個欄位都對應一個已註冊的 `SimpleQuote`。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:543 cb8e26c6aa304b8082efd725f0c2fc06
msgid ""
"**Batched updates take one recalculation, not N** — but only in the "
"deferred form. `UpdateMarket` wraps its writes in "
"`ObservableSettings::instance().disableUpdates(true)` / "
"`enableUpdates()`, and the argument is not optional: with the default "
"`false`, `notifyObservers()` hands the observers to "
"`registerDeferredObservers()`, which keeps them only when "
"`updatesDeferred()` is set (`ql/patterns/observable.hpp:165`). The drop "
"form therefore leaves `calculated_` set and the next `NPV()` returns the "
"pre-update price, silently. The one in-tree use of the drop form "
"(`ql/pricingengines/swaption/blackswaptionengine.hpp:247-249`) wants "
"exactly that: it is suppressing a cascade from a temporary engine swap, "
"not batching. `UpdateGuard` in `src/session/updateguard.hpp` exists so "
"this cannot be got wrong by accident."
msgstr "**批次更新只觸發一次重算，而不是 N 次**——但只限於延後的形式。`UpdateMarket` 把它的寫入包在 `ObservableSettings::instance().disableUpdates(true)` / `enableUpdates()` 之間，而這個引數不是可有可無的：使用預設的 `false` 時，`notifyObservers()` 會把觀察者交給 `registerDeferredObservers()`，而後者只有在 `updatesDeferred()` 設定時才會保留它們（`ql/patterns/observable.hpp:165`）。因此丟棄的形式會讓 `calculated_` 保持設定，下一次 `NPV()` 就悄悄回傳更新前的價格。原始碼樹中唯一使用丟棄形式的地方（`ql/pricingengines/swaption/blackswaptionengine.hpp:247-249`）要的正是這個效果：它是在壓制暫時替換引擎所引發的連鎖通知，而不是在做批次。`src/session/updateguard.hpp` 中的 `UpdateGuard` 存在的目的，就是讓這件事不會因為意外而出錯。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:557 b539d62a5db5485abe3b945e8c7e18b4
msgid "6. Protobuf: the schema is the work, the wire format is not"
msgstr "6. Protobuf：結構描述才是工作量，傳輸格式不是"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:559 3f0eef72fc714fd19ebd402635825a5a
msgid ""
"`Real` is `QL_REAL` (`ql/types.hpp`), `double` by default, so proto "
"`double` is correct today. If a worker is ever built against an AD type —"
" QuantLib has active AD-compatibility work — `Real` stops being `double`;"
" all numbers are therefore converted at the serialization boundary "
"through the `wire()` helper in `worker.cpp`. QuantLib's own `value()` "
"(`test-suite/utilities.hpp:53-58`) lives in the test suite and is *not* "
"installed with the library, so it cannot be called from here. `wire()` is"
" an overload pair instead: an exact match on `double` in a stock build, "
"and a template that resolves an AD type's own `value()` by argument-"
"dependent lookup otherwise."
msgstr "`Real` 是 `QL_REAL`（`ql/types.hpp`），預設為 `double`，所以目前 proto 的 `double` 是正確的。如果將來有工作者以 AD 型別建置——QuantLib 正在積極進行 AD 相容的工作——`Real` 就不再是 `double`；因此所有數字都在序列化邊界上透過 `worker.cpp` 中的 `wire()` 輔助函式轉換。QuantLib 自己的 `value()`（`test-suite/utilities.hpp:53-58`）位於測試套件中，*不會*隨函式庫安裝，所以這裡無法呼叫它。`wire()` 改為一組多載：在標準建置中精確匹配 `double`，否則以一個樣板透過引數相依查找解析 AD 型別自己的 `value()`。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:569 37690da5f766473889e72c60ccb3e7eb
msgid ""
"QuantLib conventions are polymorphic objects with no reflection and no "
"string-to-object factory. `ql/utilities/dataparsers.hpp` offers "
"`PeriodParser::parse` and `DateParser::parseISO` and nothing more. "
"Everything else is the hand-written registry in `src/conventions/`. "
"Expect it to be the largest single component of the backend and to need "
"an update whenever a convention is added."
msgstr "QuantLib 的慣例是沒有反射、也沒有字串轉物件工廠的多型物件。`ql/utilities/dataparsers.hpp` 只提供 `PeriodParser::parse` 與 `DateParser::parseISO`，僅此而已。其他一切都是 `src/conventions/` 中手寫的註冊表。預期它會是後端中最大的單一元件，而且每新增一種慣例就需要更新。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:576 c79a837ecfd0462abeed3c20ebd6ccde
msgid "Two schema hazards drove the design in `conventions.proto`:"
msgstr "兩個結構描述上的陷阱驅動了 `conventions.proto` 的設計："

#: ../../DESIGN.md:578 ffb3b02f4c484033bf9e03f69e2a68bd
msgid ""
"**Proto3 enums default to 0 and cannot distinguish unset from first "
"value.** Every convention enum reserves `0` as `*_UNSPECIFIED` and the "
"registry rejects it with `QL_REQUIRE`. Without this, a field the frontend"
" forgot to set silently prices on whatever sits at 0."
msgstr "**Proto3 列舉預設為 0，無法區分未設定與第一個值**。每個慣例列舉都把 `0` 保留為 `*_UNSPECIFIED`，註冊表則以 `QL_REQUIRE` 拒絕它。少了這一點，前端忘了設定的欄位就會悄悄以恰好位於 0 的那個值定價。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:582 eb285a756c3d4ff7af6a7f888702c975
msgid ""
"**QuantLib's numeric enum values cannot be reused as proto values.** "
"`Frequency` has `NoFrequency = -1` and `Once = 0` "
"(`ql/time/frequency.hpp:37-38`) — the first is a negative varint, the "
"second collides with the reserved unspecified slot. The mapping is "
"explicit and one-directional, never a cast."
msgstr "**QuantLib 的列舉數值不能直接當作 proto 的值。**`Frequency` 有 `NoFrequency = -1` 與 `Once = 0`（`ql/time/frequency.hpp:37-38`）——前者是負的 varint，後者則與保留的未指定位置衝突。對應是明確且單向的，絕不是強制轉型。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:588 b9b1bc848e674038a20df36d09c1f180
msgid "6.1 Where the registry pattern stops working"
msgstr "6.1 註冊表模式失效之處"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:590 3ad7f30107544668ab08f097e9ace124
msgid ""
"Conventions are objects, so a `switch` can return them. Curve "
"bootstrapping is not: `PiecewiseYieldCurve<Traits, Interpolator>` is a "
"template, and every traits/interpolator pair is a distinct type that must"
" be named in source."
msgstr "慣例是物件，所以一個 `switch` 就能回傳它們。曲線拔靴則不然：`PiecewiseYieldCurve<Traits, Interpolator>` 是一個樣板，每一組 traits／內插器的組合都是一個必須在原始碼中寫出名字的不同型別。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:594 5604a2fcbaf146ec8656552e25651c45
msgid ""
"There is no lookup table that can produce one from a wire value. What "
"`Session::makeCurve` holds instead is an explicit instantiation table — "
"the cross-product, written out — which is why `BootstrappedCurve` offers "
"three traits and three interpolators rather than QuantLib's full set. "
"Each addition is a line of source and a recompile, and each instantiation"
" costs compile time and object size, so the schema stays small on "
"purpose. The same applies to any other template-parameterised machinery "
"exposed over the wire (RNG traits on the Monte Carlo engines, for "
"instance): the enum is a menu of what was compiled in, never a "
"description of what QuantLib can do."
msgstr "沒有任何查找表能從傳輸值產生出一個這樣的型別。`Session::makeCurve` 持有的是一張明確實例化表——把笛卡兒積逐一寫出來——這就是為什麼 `BootstrappedCurve` 只提供三種 traits 與三種內插器，而不是 QuantLib 的完整組合。每一項新增都是一行原始碼加上一次重新編譯，每一個實例化都要付出編譯時間與目的檔大小，所以結構描述刻意保持精簡。同樣的道理適用於任何經由傳輸暴露、以樣板參數化的機制（例如蒙地卡羅引擎上的 RNG traits）：列舉是一份「編譯進去了什麼」的菜單，絕不是「QuantLib 能做什麼」的描述。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:604 cc231e9975cd4b45bab7fe9042b0cae1
msgid ""
"Related: `DayCounter` and `Calendar` are messages rather than enums, "
"because `Thirty360` and `ActualActual` take a sub-convention "
"(`ql/time/daycounters/thirty360.hpp:78`, "
"`ql/time/daycounters/actualactual.hpp:53`), `UnitedStates` has no default"
" constructor and requires a `Market` "
"(`ql/time/calendars/unitedstates.hpp:206`), and joint calendars nest "
"(`ql/time/calendars/jointcalendar.hpp:84`)."
msgstr "相關的一點：`DayCounter` 與 `Calendar` 是訊息而不是列舉，因為 `Thirty360` 與 `ActualActual` 需要一個子慣例（`ql/time/daycounters/thirty360.hpp:78`、`ql/time/daycounters/actualactual.hpp:53`），`UnitedStates` 沒有預設建構子並且需要一個 `Market`（`ql/time/calendars/unitedstates.hpp:206`），而聯合行事曆可以巢狀組合（`ql/time/calendars/jointcalendar.hpp:84`）。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:611 23cc4c89efcb4bd1b2a4a90898675623
