#: ../../DESIGN.md:623 b84b92ca7b43482d892928dd3302f55e
msgid ""
"`v1` still occupies the same four slots, because §6.3 imports its "
"`conventions.proto` rather than forking it. The alias is the only line "
"that had to move when the service changed generation, which is the whole "
"return on the segment."
msgstr "`v1` 仍然佔著同樣的四個位置，因為 §6.3 匯入它的 `conventions.proto`，而不是分叉一份。服務換代時唯一必須修改的就是那行別名，而這就是版本路徑段的全部回報。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:628 3451e5e688ff418e9c89a662283a0235
msgid ""
"The directory has to mirror the package because `protoc` resolves imports"
" by path relative to `-I proto`: `import "
"\"quantlib/v1/conventions.proto\"` (`envelope.proto:17`) is a filesystem "
"path, not a package reference. The free choice is whether there is a "
"version segment at all, and the layout `<package-"
"path>/<version>/<file>.proto` is the Protobuf community convention."
msgstr "目錄必須對應套件，因為 `protoc` 是以相對於 `-I proto` 的路徑解析匯入：`import \"quantlib/v1/conventions.proto\"`（`envelope.proto:17`）是檔案系統路徑，不是套件參照。可以自由選擇的是要不要有版本路徑段，而 `<package-path>/<version>/<file>.proto` 這種配置是 Protobuf 社群的慣例。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:634 1a875cb358584e33bb40e8477f9265a2
msgid ""
"**What it is for.** Protobuf's own compatibility rules cover only "
"additive change: a new field, a new enum value, a removed field whose "
"number is reserved. A change outside that set cannot be expressed by "
"editing this package at all — renumbering a field, changing its type, or "
"deleting a message a deployed client still sends. The convention is then "
"to add `quantlib/v2/` *beside* `v1` and serve both through a transition, "
"and that works precisely because the version is in the package: the two "
"generate into `quantlib::v1` and `quantlib::v2`, register in the "
"descriptor pool under distinct full names, and land in distinct header "
"paths, so one binary can link and serve both. Without the segment, an "
"incompatible change forces every client to cut over in the same release."
msgstr "**它的用途**。Protobuf 自己的相容性規則只涵蓋增補式的變更：新的欄位、新的列舉值、編號被保留的已移除欄位。超出這個範圍的變更，根本無法靠編輯這個套件來表達——重新編號欄位、改變欄位型別，或刪除已部署用戶端仍在送出的訊息。這時的慣例是在 `v1` *旁邊*新增 `quantlib/v2/`，並在過渡期間同時提供兩者，而這之所以行得通，正是因為版本在套件名稱裡：兩者分別產生到 `quantlib::v1` 與 `quantlib::v2`，以不同的完整名稱註冊到描述子池，並落在不同的標頭路徑，所以一個執行檔可以同時連結並提供兩者。沒有這個路徑段，不相容的變更就會迫使所有用戶端在同一個版本發布中一起切換。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:646 ad97b9ec0364407bb046ba7ae3a25820
msgid ""
"**The dangerous class is not the one the wire format catches.** "
"Renumbering a field breaks loudly. Reusing a field number for a different"
" meaning, or redefining what an existing value denotes while leaving its "
"type alone, is wire-compatible and silently wrong — the same failure mode"
" the `*_UNSPECIFIED` rule in §6 exists to prevent, one level up. A change"
" of that kind needs `v2` even though nothing in the encoding would "
"object."
msgstr "**危險的那一類，不是傳輸格式抓得到的那一類**。重新編號欄位會大聲地壞掉。把欄位編號重新用於不同的意義，或在不改型別的情況下重新定義既有值代表什麼，則在傳輸上相容卻悄悄出錯——正是 §6 的 `*_UNSPECIFIED` 規則要防止的同一種失敗模式，只是高了一層。這種變更即使編碼上沒有任何東西會反對，也需要 `v2`。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:653 4845d7d918f044119063845484f8daa0
msgid ""
"**The rule.** Stay on a version while every change is additive; open the "
"next one the first time a change is not. The quanto family was the worked"
" example on the additive side: within `v1` it added messages, oneof arms,"
" enum values, and the fields `CurveDefinition.flat`, `Engine.fd_grid` and"
" `PriceResult.fd_grid` — all additive, so a `PriceRequest` serialized "
"before it still parsed after it. (Those are `v1` field names; §6.3 spells"
" the same ideas differently, which is exactly what makes it a version "
"rather than an extension.)"
msgstr "**規則**。只要每個變更都是增補式的，就留在同一個版本；第一次出現非增補式的變更時，就開下一版。quanto 系列是增補那一側的實例：在 `v1` 中它新增了訊息、oneof 分支、列舉值，以及 `CurveDefinition.flat`、`Engine.fd_grid` 與 `PriceResult.fd_grid` 這些欄位——全部都是增補式的，所以在它之前序列化的 `PriceRequest` 在它之後仍能解析。（那些是 `v1` 的欄位名稱；§6.3 用不同的方式表達同樣的概念，而這正是它是一個新版本而不是一次擴充的原因。）"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:661 71810c4a7b4d43418b551d9599578ede
msgid ""
"**It earned its keep sooner than expected.** The reasoning above was "
"written against a hypothetical `v2`; §6.3 is one, and it arrived from a "
"survey rather than from a deployment. The cost of having the segment "
"already there was a directory level; the cost of not having it would have"
" been renaming the package line, every import, every generated include "
"path and the `qlpb` alias, in a tree where `v1` still has to keep "
"working."
msgstr "**它比預期更早派上用場**。上面的推理是針對一個假設中的 `v2` 寫的；§6.3 就是一個真正的新版本，而它來自一次盤點，而不是一次部署。預先放好路徑段的代價是多一層目錄；沒有它的代價則會是在一棵 `v1` 仍須持續運作的原始碼樹中，改掉套件那一行、每一個匯入、每一個產生的引入路徑，以及 `qlpb` 別名。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:668 26b9b3f9179a492f948d68400d0dc85a
msgid "6.3 The general schema"
msgstr "6.3 通用結構描述"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:670 963e66cf3ace44bbb76a59f8e299d5de
msgid ""
"`proto/quantlib/v2/` is `v1` re-derived from QuantLib's own decomposition"
" instead of from the two instruments that happened to be needed first. It"
" is what the service speaks; the paragraph below on what is implemented "
"says how much of it is served."
msgstr "`proto/quantlib/v2/` 是從 QuantLib 自己的分解方式重新推導出來的 `v1`，而不是從剛好最先需要的那兩種金融工具推導出來。服務說的就是它；下面關於實作了什麼的段落說明其中有多少實際提供服務。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:675 fb68cb98e50c4f74a81e962f0a78b5c4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Where it comes from.** QuantLib's `test-suite/` is 188 `.cpp` files, "
"and its test-data structs are an inventory of what a pricing request has "
"to carry. They rhyme. `EuropeanOptionData`, `AmericanOptionData`, "
"`DigitalOptionData`, `ForwardOptionData` and `BasketOptionOneData` are "
"the same seven fields — `{type, strike, s, q, r, t, v}` — and every "
"exotic is those seven plus a small block: `NewBarrierOptionData` adds a "
"barrier, a rebate and an exercise type, `DiscreteAverageData` adds "
"fixings and a running average, `LookbackOptionData` adds an extremum and "
"a window. The recurring part is the underlying and its market; the "
"varying part is small, named, and per shape."
msgstr "**它從哪裡來**。QuantLib 的 `test-suite/` 有 188 個 `.cpp` 檔，其中的測試資料結構就是一份「定價請求必須攜帶什麼」的清單。它們彼此呼應。`EuropeanOptionData`、`AmericanOptionData`、`DigitalOptionData`、`ForwardOptionData` 與 `BasketOptionOneData` 是同樣的七個欄位——`{type, strike, s, q, r, t, v}`——而每一種新奇選擇權都是這七個欄位再加上一小塊：`NewBarrierOptionData` 加上障礙、回扣與履約類型，`DiscreteAverageData` 加上定盤值與累計平均，`LookbackOptionData` 加上極值與觀察區間。重複出現的部分是標的與它的市場；變動的部分很小、有名字，而且依形狀而異。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:685 a112cccfd31644e6886c49b55425cbca
msgid ""
"**What `v1` costs.** It writes one message per product, so the fields "
"common to all of them are re-declared per product and the message count "
"grows as shape × quanto × exercise. It is already visible: "
"`VanillaOption`, `QuantoVanillaOption`, `QuantoForwardVanillaOption`, "
"`QuantoBarrierOption` and `QuantoDoubleBarrierOption` each declare "
"`type`, `strike` and `expiry`; the barrier fields appear twice; a plain "
"barrier option would be a sixth message duplicating all of it; an "
"American vanilla would be a seventh. None of those duplications is a "
"distinction QuantLib makes."
msgstr "**`v1` 的代價**。它為每種產品寫一則訊息，所以所有產品共有的欄位在每種產品裡都重新宣告一次，訊息數量則以形狀 × quanto × 履約的方式增長。這已經看得出來：`VanillaOption`、`QuantoVanillaOption`、`QuantoForwardVanillaOption`、`QuantoBarrierOption` 與 `QuantoDoubleBarrierOption` 各自宣告了 `type`、`strike` 與 `expiry`；障礙欄位出現兩次；一般的障礙選擇權會是第六則把這一切再複製一遍的訊息；美式香草選擇權會是第七則。這些重複沒有一個是 QuantLib 所做的區分。"

