#: ../../DESIGN.md:706 de417550e32840379ee6c9f8c53baf0b
msgid ""
"The four quanto messages collapse into zero: quanto stops being a product"
" and becomes what it is in QuantLib, an adjustment to the engine, so it "
"composes with any style instead of needing a message per pairing."
msgstr "四則 quanto 訊息收斂為零則：quanto 不再是一種產品，而是回到它在 QuantLib 中的本來面目——對引擎的一種調整，因此它能與任何樣式組合，不必為每一種搭配各寫一則訊息。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:710 cb8428b1e85d4ffeb6af54e316aeb90e
msgid ""
"**`style` is a oneof, not a repeated feature list.** The composable form "
"is the obvious generalization and it is wrong. QuantLib has a fixed menu "
"of instrument classes; there is no quanto-barrier-lookback, and a "
"repeated feature list would have the schema promise a product space "
"perhaps a tenth of which can be built, with the other nine tenths failing"
" at runtime with no way for a client to know in advance. A oneof says "
"what exists. Quanto sits outside it because it is the one axis that "
"genuinely is orthogonal — and it is orthogonal precisely because it wraps"
" the engine rather than the instrument."
msgstr "**`style` 是一個 oneof，而不是可重複的特徵清單**。可組合的形式是顯而易見的一般化，而它是錯的。QuantLib 有一份固定的金融工具類別清單；沒有 quanto-障礙-回顧式這種東西，而可重複的特徵清單會讓結構描述承諾一個大概只有十分之一能建構出來的產品空間，另外十分之九則在執行時失敗，用戶端也無從事先得知。oneof 說的是實際存在什麼。quanto 放在它之外，因為它是唯一真正正交的軸——而它之所以正交，正是因為它包裝的是引擎，而不是金融工具。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:719 c12dddac0c394a39a9bc9349ef1a8127
msgid ""
"**The market becomes a namespace.** In `v1` each instrument named the "
"market objects it needed in its own fields, which made the market a "
"property of the trade and meant a new instrument added market fields. In "
"`v2` the session owns an ordered list of `MarketObject`, each with an id,"
" and instruments refer to ids. That is what makes it possible to add a "
"volatility surface at all: the test suite builds `BlackVarianceSurface`, "
"`BlackVarianceCurve` and three kinds of local volatility, and `v1` has no"
" object to put any of them in — volatility enters as a single quote and "
"every instrument gets a `BlackConstantVol`. Same for interpolated zero "
"curves, which the test suite uses more often than bootstrapped ones "
"(`zerocurve.hpp` in 28 files against `piecewiseyieldcurve.hpp` in 13), "
"and for `IndexManager` fixings, which nothing in `v1` populates at all."
msgstr "**市場成為一個命名空間**。在 `v1` 中，每個金融工具在自己的欄位裡指名它需要的市場物件，這讓市場成了交易的屬性，也意味著每新增一種金融工具就要新增市場欄位。在 `v2` 中，工作階段擁有一份有序的 `MarketObject` 清單，每個都有代號，金融工具則以代號參照它們。正是這一點才讓加入波動率曲面成為可能：測試套件會建構 `BlackVarianceSurface`、`BlackVarianceCurve` 以及三種局部波動率，而 `v1` 沒有任何物件可以容納它們——波動率以單一報價的形式進來，每個金融工具拿到的都是 `BlackConstantVol`。內插的零息曲線也一樣，測試套件使用它的頻率比拔靴曲線還高（`zerocurve.hpp` 出現在 28 個檔案中，`piecewiseyieldcurve.hpp` 則是 13 個）；`IndexManager` 的定盤值也是，`v1` 中根本沒有任何東西會填入它。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:731 645ccad3755a4dac8c38793bdd805948
msgid ""
"**The output half was the more wrong one.** `v1`'s `PriceResult.results` "
"is `map<string, double>`. QuantLib's `additionalResults` is `map<string, "
"any>`, and the engines put vectors and matrices in it — `forwards`, "
"`probabilities`, `spotVols`, `TimeGrid`, per-leg `legNPV` — which are "
"exactly the results worth plotting rather than printing. A double-valued "
"map drops every one of them, and drops them silently. `v2` carries a "
"`Value` variant that mirrors the `any`, and adds the two things a panel "
"needs that no engine publishes: a `CashFlow` table (the working behind a "
"swap price) and a `Series` (a line, with its axes named, for a curve or a"
" ladder or a convergence trace)."
msgstr "**輸出那一半錯得更多。**`v1` 的 `PriceResult.results` 是 `map<string, double>`。QuantLib 的 `additionalResults` 是 `map<string, any>`，而引擎會把向量與矩陣放進去——`forwards`、`probabilities`、`spotVols`、`TimeGrid`、每條腿的 `legNPV`——這些正是值得畫成圖而不只是印出來的結果。以 double 為值的對應表會把它們每一個都丟掉，而且是悄悄地丟掉。`v2` 帶有一個對應 `any` 的 `Value` 變體，並加上兩樣面板需要、卻沒有任何引擎會發布的東西：`CashFlow` 表（交換價格背後的計算過程），以及 `Series`（一條線，軸都有名字，用於曲線、階梯或收斂軌跡）。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:741 d7d6d25a17584b259ca2258051fec2c3
msgid ""
"**`Flag` closes the hole `*_UNSPECIFIED` left open.** §6 rejects zero for"
" every convention enum because proto3 cannot tell unset from the first "
"value. The same hole is open for every `bool`, and `v1` has several: "
"`end_of_month` on a swap leg, `performance` on a quanto forward. A "
"forgotten one prices as `false` with no complaint. `v2` uses a three-"
"valued `Flag` wherever the bit moves a price or its sign — end-of-month, "
"in-arrears, pay-or-receive, long-or-short, payoff-at-expiry, knock-in — "
"and keeps plain `bool` for request options, where `false` is a smaller "
"answer rather than a wrong one. The rule: a flag that changes the number "
"is a `Flag`, a flag that changes the reply is a `bool`."
msgstr "**`Flag` 補上了 `*_UNSPECIFIED` 留下的漏洞。**§6 對每個慣例列舉都拒絕零值，因為 proto3 無法分辨未設定與第一個值。同樣的漏洞在每一個 `bool` 上都存在，而 `v1` 有好幾個：交換腿上的 `end_of_month`、quanto 遠期上的 `performance`。忘了設定的那一個會以 `false` 定價，毫無抱怨。`v2` 在任何會影響價格或其正負號的位元上都使用三值的 `Flag`——月底、後付、支付或收取、多頭或空頭、到期時支付、敲入——而在請求選項上保留普通的 `bool`，因為在那裡 `false` 只是比較精簡的回答，而不是錯誤的回答。規則是：會改變數字的旗標是 `Flag`，會改變回覆內容的旗標是 `bool`。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:752 fe8b0e0118784bcb8b961244b7f9b1dc
msgid ""
"**`Scenario` is the session model's payoff, made explicit.** A spot "
"ladder is one frame, one graph, and N lazy recomputes of only what the "
"bumped quote invalidated — against N round trips that each rebuild "
"everything. That is the entire argument for a stateful backend (§5), and "
"until this schema nothing let a client ask for it in one request. It is "
"`repeated Scenario scenarios` on the same field number the singular one "
"had, because a message field and a one-element repeated field are the "
"same bytes: the grid arrived without a version. Several axes multiply "
"into one row-major surface, still one frame and still one graph, which is"
" the same argument with a dimension added."
msgstr "**`Scenario` 是工作階段模型的回報，明確地呈現出來**。一條現貨階梯是一個訊框、一個物件圖，以及 N 次只重算被調動報價所影響部分的惰性重算——相較之下是 N 次各自重建一切的往返。這就是有狀態後端的全部論據（§5），而在這份結構描述之前，沒有任何東西能讓用戶端在一個請求中要求它。它是 `repeated Scenario scenarios`，沿用單數版本原本的欄位編號，因為訊息欄位與只有一個元素的重複欄位是相同的位元組：網格就這樣在不換版本的情況下加了進來。多個軸相乘成一個列優先排列的曲面，仍然是一個訊框、一個物件圖，這是同一個論據再加上一個維度。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:762 981cf9ef8e414487b55b28fb6676a54a
msgid ""
"**What arrived after this section was first written.** Five additions, "
"each because a client could not otherwise ask a question the service "
"could answer: `Hello`/`Capabilities`, so the support matrix is served "
"rather than copied into every client; `PriceResult.unavailable_results`, "
"so an engine that cannot supply a greek names the absence instead of "
"returning a map the client has to diff; `ImpliedVolatility`, the one "
"result computed from an input the request carries rather than from the "
"market; `PriceBatch`/`BatchResult`, a book against one graph in one frame"
" with a failing entry costing one row; and `CurveSample`, so a panel "
"draws the term structure the engine priced against rather than one it "
"rebuilt. Each is additive, which is what kept them inside `v2` under the "
"rule in §6.2."
msgstr "**這一節初次寫成之後又加入了什麼**。五項新增，每一項都是因為用戶端否則就無法提出一個服務其實答得出來的問題：`Hello`/`Capabilities`，讓支援矩陣由服務提供，而不是複製到每個用戶端裡；`PriceResult.unavailable_results`，讓無法提供某個希臘字母的引擎指名這項缺席，而不是回傳一張要用戶端自己比對差異的對應表；`ImpliedVolatility`，唯一一個由請求攜帶的輸入、而不是由市場算出的結果；`PriceBatch`/`BatchResult`，在一個訊框中以一個物件圖處理整本交易簿，失敗的項目只損失一列；以及 `CurveSample`，讓面板畫出的是引擎定價時實際使用的期限結構，而不是它自己重建的那一條。每一項都是增補式的，這讓它們依 §6.2 的規則留在 `v2` 之內。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:774 f45ceff521014e28812574ad6f058fdd
msgid ""
"**The port.** `ql-backend` moved to `v2` in the same pass: `Session` is "
"rebuilt around the market namespace and the payoff x exercise x style "
"decomposition, and the transport above it — worker, supervisor, gateway —"
" carries `v2` frames. `v1` remains in the tree because `v2` imports its "
"conventions and because §6.2 is about it, but nothing serves it and its "
"three client scripts are gone."
msgstr "**移植。**`ql-backend` 在同一次改動中轉移到 `v2`：`Session` 圍繞著市場命名空間與收益函數 × 履約 × 樣式的分解重建，而它上面的傳輸層——工作者、監督者、閘道——承載 `v2` 訊框。`v1` 仍留在原始碼樹中，因為 `v2` 匯入它的慣例，也因為 §6.2 談的就是它，但沒有任何東西提供它的服務，它的三支用戶端腳本也已經移除。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:780 b7fa113728724d9999bfa88e4bea0bdb
msgid ""
"**What is implemented, and what is only in the schema.** The one-asset "
"option family is live: eight payoffs, three exercises, and the vanilla, "
"barrier, double-barrier, forward-start, Asian, lookback, compound, "
"chooser, cliquet and the multi-asset basket, against analytic (including "
"the three American approximations), lattice, finite-difference, integral "
"and Monte Carlo engines, with quanto composing over the shapes QuantLib "
"has a wrappable engine for. Swaps are the general n-leg `Swap` rather "
"than `VanillaSwap`. The market builds quotes, "
"flat/interpolated/bootstrapped yield curves, three volatility shapes, "
"Ibor and overnight indices, and past fixings."
msgstr "**實作了什麼，又有什麼只存在於結構描述中**。單一資產的選擇權家族已經上線：八種收益函數、三種履約，以及香草、障礙、雙障礙、遠期起始、亞式、回顧式、複合、選擇者、棘輪與多資產籃子，搭配解析（包括三種美式近似法）、格點、有限差分、積分與蒙地卡羅引擎，而 quanto 可以組合在 QuantLib 具備可包裝引擎的那些形狀上。交換是通用的 n 條腿 `Swap`，而不是 `VanillaSwap`。市場可以建構報價、平坦／內插／拔靴的殖利率曲線、三種波動率形狀、Ibor 與隔夜指數，以及過去的定盤值。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:790 5105a7e6f4bd4e0da66b9220f6323d47
msgid ""
"Not implemented, and rejected by name as `UNSUPPORTED` rather than "
"mispriced: bonds, credit, inflation, FX forwards, variance swaps, "
"swaptions, caps and floors; the two styles the schema carries and this "
"build does not price, both of which are the schema describing something "
"twice rather than an engine missing — `spread`, which QuantLib 1.43 "
"prices as a basket kind, and `digital`, which is a barrier carrying a "
"binary payoff; discrete dividends, discretely monitored and partial-time "
"barriers; the Heston, Bates and local-volatility processes; and the "
"correlation matrix, which the schema carries for the basket case the "
"engines do not yet cover. Each is the same work the quanto family was — a"
" registry mapping, an explicit instantiation table where a template is "
"involved (§6.1), and a test row with a reference value — and the schema "
"is now the part that does not have to be redesigned each time."
msgstr "尚未實作、並以名稱明確以 `UNSUPPORTED` 拒絕而不是算錯價格的有：債券、信用、通膨、外匯遠期、變異數交換、交換選擇權、利率上限與下限；結構描述中有、但這個建置不定價的兩種樣式，兩者都是結構描述把同一件事描述了兩次，而不是缺少引擎——`spread`，QuantLib 1.43 把它當作一種籃子來定價，以及 `digital`，它是帶有二元收益函數的障礙選擇權；離散股利、離散監控與部分時間的障礙；Heston、Bates 與局部波動率過程；以及相關係數矩陣，結構描述為了引擎尚未涵蓋的籃子情況而帶著它。每一項都是與 quanto 家族相同的工作——一條註冊表對應、涉及樣板時的一張明確實例化表（§6.1），以及一列附參考值的測試——而結構描述如今已是不必每次重新設計的那一部分。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:804 4a5261c06f9041c688265aea917003b7
msgid ""
"**How it is checked.** `test/smoke_v2.py` prices 369 rows of QuantLib's "
"own published reference values over the wire and compares each against "
"the value its test suite records, at the tolerance that test uses. The "
"rows are not transcribed: `test/extract_tables.py` parses them out of "
"`test-suite/*.cpp`, which is the only way a benchmark stays one."
msgstr "**如何檢查。**`test/smoke_v2.py` 透過傳輸為 369 列 QuantLib 自己發布的參考值定價，並以該測試所用的容差，將每一列與其測試套件記錄的值比較。這些列不是手抄的：`test/extract_tables.py` 從 `test-suite/*.cpp` 中把它們解析出來，這是讓基準一直是基準的唯一方法。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:810 f73b27e976094af6808101ce20a0f119
msgid "7. Prior art"
msgstr "7. 前人的做法"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:812 18b226d407d2466093bab305fa7dc869
msgid ""
"ORE (Open Source Risk Engine) is QuantLib plus exactly the configuration "
"and serialization layer this design reinvents. Its schemas are XML rather"
" than Protobuf, but the decomposition — trade definitions, market "
"definitions, convention registry — is worth reading before extending "
"`conventions.proto`."
msgstr "ORE（Open Source Risk Engine）就是 QuantLib 加上這個設計所重新發明的那一層設定與序列化。它的結構描述是 XML 而不是 Protobuf，但它的分解方式——交易定義、市場定義、慣例註冊表——值得在擴充 `conventions.proto` 之前讀一讀。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:817 54710f32dcf84dd881c0f3c602b3e81f
msgid "8. Open decisions"
msgstr "8. 尚未定案的決定"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:819 f16a0b6ea8c54e0f87fd66d039a70370
msgid ""
"Curve bootstrap ownership: per-session rebuild (assumed here) versus a "
"shared, thread-safe-observer curve cache. Revisit only if bootstrap time "
"dominates a session's first response."
msgstr "曲線拔靴的歸屬：每個工作階段各自重建（本文的假設），或是採用執行緒安全觀察者的共用曲線快取。只有當拔靴時間主導了工作階段的第一次回應時才需要重新檢討。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:822 42c3aa0e7de74434a91081e89b9ae156
msgid ""
"Warm spare workers: replay after a `CANCELLED` kill costs a full "
"bootstrap (`SessionOpened.bootstrap_seconds` measures it per session). "
"Whether that needs a pre-warmed pool depends on how long the bootstrap "
"actually takes, which is worth measuring before building one. The same "
"measurement settles the retire-on-empty rule in §2.1: holding an idle "
"process instead trades memory for a fork on the next session, and a "
"session that alternates placements pays that fork each way."
msgstr "預熱的備用工作者：`CANCELLED` 的 kill 之後的重播要付出一次完整的拔靴（`SessionOpened.bootstrap_seconds` 會為每個工作階段量測它）。是否需要一個預熱池，取決於拔靴實際上花多久，而這值得在動手打造之前先量測。同一份量測也能決定 §2.1 中清空即退役的規則：保留一個閒置行程，是以記憶體換取下一個工作階段省下一次 fork，而交替改變安置的工作階段每個方向都要付一次 fork。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:829 33ef4c29f44a4b6898c4f6418fed2f3b
msgid ""
"The §2.1 dispatch rule — which requests count as \"long\" and go to a "
"sacrificial process — is currently by engine kind. Sample count may be "
"the better signal."
msgstr "§2.1 的派送規則——哪些請求算是「耗時」而送往可犧牲的行程——目前以引擎種類判斷。樣本數可能是更好的訊號。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:832 37e1de4cc9e24400a346f5bf95392f77
msgid ""
"Whether the shared pool should be capped. Today every session gets a seat"
" and a full pool grows by a process, so `sessionsPerSharedWorker` bounds "
"a kill's blast radius and nothing else (§2.1); a client that opens a "
"session per strike oversubscribes the cores rather than queueing. A cap "
"with a queue in front of it is the alternative, and it needs a "
"measurement of what a fanned-out panel actually does to a box before it "
"is worth its latency."
msgstr "共用池是否應該設上限。目前每個工作階段都能拿到座位，滿了的池就再增加一個行程，所以 `sessionsPerSharedWorker` 限制的是 kill 的波及範圍，其他什麼都不限制（§2.1）；為每個履約價開一個工作階段的用戶端會超額使用核心，而不是排隊。在前面放一個佇列的上限是另一種做法，而在它值得那份延遲之前，需要先量測一個展開的面板實際上會對機器造成什麼影響。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:839 3fa833b9c871443b80cb57878f5c40ea
msgid ""
"Whether an OpenMP-enabled worker binary is worth maintaining for the "
"sacrificial processes (§2.2). It would help binomial and FD requests and "
"nothing else, and it doubles the build matrix, so it needs a measured win"
" on a real request before it earns its place."
msgstr "是否值得為可犧牲的行程維護一個啟用 OpenMP 的工作者執行檔（§2.2）。它只對二元樹與有限差分請求有幫助，而且會讓建置矩陣加倍，所以它得先在真實請求上量到實際的好處，才配得上它的位置。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:843 290079678dcb49c1b711787546df4a13
msgid ""
"Whether `Progress` also carries a running NPV estimate, which is cheap "
"for Monte Carlo and meaningless for calibration."
msgstr "`Progress` 是否也要攜帶一個持續更新的 NPV 估計值，這對蒙地卡羅很便宜，對校準則毫無意義。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:845 e1aa6ee899d64aaeadd7e1b7fe54e126
msgid ""
"~~Whether a reconnecting client may resume its sessions rather than "
"reopen them (§9.4).~~ **Settled, and not the way this list expected.** "
"The measurement it asked for says a rebuild costs single-digit "
"milliseconds, so resuming to save a bootstrap would not have been worth a"
" held seat. Resuming to save the *work in flight* is: `ResumeSession` and"
" a 60-second window are in §9.4, and the client identity the protocol did"
" not have is a token minted per session rather than per client."
msgstr "~~重新連線的用戶端是否可以接回它的工作階段，而不是重新開啟（§9.4）。~~ **已經定案，而且不是這份清單預期的方式**。它要求的量測顯示重建只要個位數毫秒，所以為了省下一次拔靴而接回，並不值得保留一個座位。為了保住*進行中的工作*而接回則值得：`ResumeSession` 與 60 秒的寬限期寫在 §9.4，而協定原本沒有的用戶端身分，則是一個按工作階段、而不是按用戶端鑄發的權杖。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:852 b4f49c1325344b98a5f361be5e22619c
msgid ""
"Whether the gateway persists session logs. Today it does not, which is "
"what makes it the single point of failure §1.1 admits to — and, per §1.3,"
" the one thing standing between sharding sessions across gateways and "
"failing them over between gateways."
msgstr "閘道是否要持久化工作階段日誌。目前不會，這使它成為 §1.1 所承認的單點故障——而依 §1.3，這也是「把工作階段分片到多個閘道」與「在閘道之間容錯移轉」之間唯一的差距。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:857 5a47256b7c6f47dba0551e7ffc021d7b
msgid "9. The gateway"
msgstr "9. 閘道"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:859 3b4ccb9886d64a4faab079086f8c981e
msgid ""
"Every section above imposes obligations on the gateway and none of them "
"designs it. This one settles the four choices that block writing it — the"
" loop, the worker channel, backpressure, and what a dropped connection "
"means — and states what the gateway has to track that nothing else does."
msgstr "上面每一節都對閘道施加了義務，卻沒有一節設計它。這一節定下阻礙撰寫它的四個選擇——迴圈、工作者通道、背壓，以及連線中斷意味著什麼——並說明閘道必須追蹤、而其他任何東西都不追蹤的那些資訊。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:864 bdf9ad39686b46a191bd2c69dacfeaf1
msgid ""
"Authentication, TLS termination, multi-tenancy and persistence are out of"
" scope, and §9.6 is what stands in for the first of them. The single "
"point of failure in §1.1 stands: this section does not mitigate it."
msgstr "身分驗證、TLS 終止、多租戶與持久化都不在範圍內，而 §9.6 是其中第一項的替代品。§1.1 中的單點故障依然存在：這一節並不緩解它。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:868 9ba5cbd727e64d54abf06408d84bd211
msgid ""
"Claims about uWebSockets below are cited against "
"`third_party/uWebSockets`, the submodule this repository pins at "
"v20.66.0, so every line number holds for the version that is actually "
"built."
msgstr "以下關於 uWebSockets 的說法都引用 `third_party/uWebSockets`——本儲存庫釘在 v20.66.0 的子模組——因此每一個行號都對應實際建置的那個版本。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:872 95547b0a086b4147b0b848dc1b8cc0d5
msgid "9.1 One loop, and everything on it"
msgstr "9.1 一個迴圈，一切都在上面"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:874 db1af6fc63f14a338e810ac2294d840a
msgid ""
"**Decision: a single-threaded event loop, uWebSockets over uSockets.** "
"This is not a preference. `Supervisor` mutates `sessions_` and `workers_`"
" from six entry points with no mutex, and that is sound only while all "
"six run on one thread (§1.1). The loop is therefore part of the "
"supervisor's correctness argument, not a transport detail underneath it."
msgstr "**決定：單執行緒事件迴圈，uWebSockets 架在 uSockets 之上**。這不是偏好。`Supervisor` 從六個進入點修改 `sessions_` 與 `workers_` 而沒有互斥鎖，而這只有在六者都在同一條執行緒上執行時才正確（§1.1）。因此迴圈是監督者正確性論證的一部分，而不是底下的傳輸細節。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:880 106e276005164eca97843443ab3da7ad
msgid ""
"Three consequences, each of which is a rule for the code that has yet to "
"be written:"
msgstr "三個結果，每一個都是給尚未寫出的程式碼的規則："

#: ../../DESIGN.md:883 0b93fa2001a74a11af33ca7026ef71d8
msgid ""
"**Nothing calls into the supervisor from another thread.** `Loop::defer` "
"(`src/Loop.h:169`) queues onto the loop thread and wakes it, and it is "
"the only sanctioned way in. A worker-side callback that reaches the "
"supervisor directly is a data race that will not reproduce under test."
msgstr "**沒有任何東西從其他執行緒呼叫進監督者。**`Loop::defer`（`src/Loop.h:169`）把工作排進迴圈執行緒並喚醒它，而它是唯一被認可的進入方式。直接碰到監督者的工作者端回呼是一個資料競爭，而且在測試中不會重現。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:887 fad53e5a7dff4ffe822f37bc2fe251d3
msgid ""
"**`DeadlineTimer` is one repeating tick, not a timer per deadline.** The "
"obvious implementation is a one-shot `us_timer_t` "
"(`uSockets/src/libusockets.h:110,120`) closed from its own callback, and "
"it is wrong: `us_timer_close` frees the timer immediately rather than "
"deferring it the way a socket close is deferred, so the dispatch loop is "
"left holding freed memory. A single `us_timer_t` firing every 25 ms "
"against a sorted queue of deadlines has no such edge. Resolution costs "
"nothing here — the only deadline is the 250 ms stop grace, and the "
"supervisor already assumes a timer it cannot disarm, which is why cancel "
"rounds carry a generation."
msgstr "**`DeadlineTimer` 是一個重複的節拍，而不是每個期限一個計時器**。顯而易見的實作是一個在自己的回呼中關閉的單次 `us_timer_t`（`uSockets/src/libusockets.h:110,120`），而它是錯的：`us_timer_close` 會立即釋放計時器，而不像關閉 socket 那樣延後處理，於是派送迴圈手上抓著的是已釋放的記憶體。單一個每 25 ms 觸發一次、對著排序好的期限佇列檢查的 `us_timer_t` 就沒有這種邊界情況。解析度在這裡毫無代價——唯一的期限是 250 ms 的停止寬限期，而監督者本來就假設計時器無法解除，這也是取消回合要帶世代編號的原因。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:896 78af936df3ba45408212cfe9c99e5540
msgid ""
"**The loop must not block.** Every long calculation is in another process"
" by construction (§3), so the only way to violate this is to do work in a"
" frame handler — parsing a large `OpenSession`, say — that belongs on the"
" worker."
msgstr "**迴圈不得阻塞**。每一個耗時的計算在結構上都位於另一個行程中（§3），所以唯一會違反這一點的方式，是在訊框處理常式中做了屬於工作者的工作——例如解析一個大型的 `OpenSession`。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:900 51083ac08d50486cb48f99126118fcb1
msgid "9.2 The worker channel"
msgstr "9.2 工作者通道"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:902 cd206ed4a62e44f49504e0e7ac6136c9
msgid ""
"Data plane and control plane leave by different routes (§1.1), and the "
"split decides the mechanism for each."
msgstr "資料平面與控制平面經由不同的路徑離開（§1.1），而這個分工決定了各自的機制。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:905 3c58d72e6efe47f39e88caf3bd09133a
msgid ""
"**Decision: frames to workers are length-prefixed.** §1 settles the wire "
"format only for WebSocket, which delimits messages for us; a pipe does "
"not. Each direction carries a 4-byte little-endian length followed by one"
" serialized `ClientFrame` or `ServerFrame` — the same types, so nothing "
"is re-encoded at the boundary and a frame can be forwarded from socket to"
" pipe without being understood."
msgstr "**決定：送往工作者的訊框帶有長度前綴。**§1 只為 WebSocket 定下傳輸格式，而 WebSocket 會替我們劃分訊息邊界；管道則不會。每個方向都傳送一個 4 位元組的小端序長度，後面接一個序列化的 `ClientFrame` 或 `ServerFrame`——同樣的型別，所以在邊界上不需要重新編碼，訊框可以在不被理解的情況下從 socket 轉送到管道。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:912 b4ea10582bfb4b5ca35118e9c5c8a366
msgid ""
"**Decision: worker pipes join the same loop as raw polls.** "
"`us_create_poll` / `us_poll_init` / `us_poll_start` "
"(`uSockets/src/libusockets.h:254,260,263`) put a worker's read end "
"directly into the event loop. The alternative — a reader thread per "
"worker calling `Loop::defer` — adds a thread per process, a queue hop per"
" frame, and an ordering question at every hand-off, in exchange for "
"nothing."
msgstr "**決定：工作者的管道以原始 poll 的形式加入同一個迴圈。**`us_create_poll` / `us_poll_init` / `us_poll_start`（`uSockets/src/libusockets.h:254,260,263`）把工作者的讀取端直接放進事件迴圈。另一種做法——每個工作者一條呼叫 `Loop::defer` 的讀取執行緒——會讓每個行程多一條執行緒、每個訊框多一次佇列轉手，並在每次交接時多一個順序問題，換來的卻什麼都沒有。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:919 53b4cdb3c8694bbc809b1fa256b94fb6
msgid ""
"**Decision: control travels out of band, and process death comes back in "
"band.** `spawn` is fork/exec, `requestStop` is a signal or a flag in "
"shared memory, and `kill` is `SIGKILL`; none may ride the frame pipe, "
"because a worker inside a Monte Carlo is not reading it and that is "
"exactly the case a cancel exists to interrupt (§3). Child exits must "
"arrive as `onWorkerDied()` **on the loop** — through a self-pipe, "
"`signalfd`, or the loop's own child watcher — never from a `SIGCHLD` "
"handler, which shares the supervisor's lack of a mutex with none of its "
"guarantees."
msgstr "**決定：控制走帶外，行程死亡則從帶內回來。**`spawn` 是 fork/exec，`requestStop` 是訊號或共享記憶體中的旗標，`kill` 則是 `SIGKILL`；它們都不能走訊框管道，因為正在蒙地卡羅中的工作者不會讀它，而這正是取消存在要打斷的情況（§3）。子行程結束必須以 `onWorkerDied()` **在迴圈上**抵達——透過 self-pipe、`signalfd` 或迴圈本身的子行程監看器——絕不能從 `SIGCHLD` 處理常式中呼叫，那裡與監督者同樣沒有互斥鎖，卻沒有監督者的任何保證。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:928 c49f59bf78c64ea0802291556ee1540b
msgid "9.3 Backpressure: shed `Progress`, never a terminal frame"
msgstr "9.3 背壓：捨棄 `Progress`，絕不捨棄終結訊框"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:930 41acecb6143145d09aecc9e15cadf65e
msgid ""
"This is the one place where the transport can break the protocol, and the"
" default configuration does."
msgstr "這是傳輸層唯一可能破壞協定的地方，而預設設定就會破壞它。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:933 dd61006e389749e2aa836d3d251d6a90
msgid ""
"`WebSocket::send` skips the message and returns `DROPPED` when buffered "
"data exceeds `maxBackpressure` (`src/WebSocket.h:92-110`), which defaults"
" to 64 KB (`src/App.h:242`), and `closeOnBackpressureLimit` defaults to "
"`false` (`src/App.h:243`). A slow client therefore loses frames while its"
" connection stays open and healthy-looking. Lose a `Progress` frame and a"
" bar stutters. Lose the terminal frame and the client waits forever for a"
" result that was computed, paid for, and discarded — which silently "
"breaks the exactly-once terminal guarantee that §3 spends a process kill "
"to provide."
msgstr "當緩衝資料超過 `maxBackpressure` 時，`WebSocket::send` 會略過訊息並回傳 `DROPPED`（`src/WebSocket.h:92-110`），而其預設值是 64 KB（`src/App.h:242`），`closeOnBackpressureLimit` 則預設為 `false`（`src/App.h:243`）。因此慢速的用戶端會在連線保持開啟、看起來一切正常的情況下遺失訊框。遺失一個 `Progress` 訊框，進度條會頓一下。遺失終結訊框，用戶端就會永遠等待一個已經算出、已經付出代價、又被丟掉的結果——這會悄悄破壞 §3 不惜 kill 一個行程也要提供的「恰好一次終結」保證。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:942 16461f635ee14127ac04c60bce0cc575
msgid ""
"**Decision: the gateway sheds `Progress` itself, before uWebSockets "
"can.** At most one `Progress` frame per request is outstanding on a "
"connection; if the previous one has not drained (`getBufferedAmount()`, "
"with the `drain` handler to resume), the next is dropped by us. Progress "
"is a hint and every frame supersedes the last, so shedding it costs "
"nothing. This keeps the buffer clear for the frames that matter."
msgstr "**決定：閘道搶在 uWebSockets 之前自己捨棄 `Progress`**。每條連線上每個請求最多只有一個未送出的 `Progress` 訊框；如果前一個還沒排空（`getBufferedAmount()`，並以 `drain` 處理常式恢復），下一個就由我們丟掉。進度只是提示，每個訊框都取代前一個，所以捨棄它不需要任何代價。這讓緩衝區留給真正重要的訊框。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:949 f51271166b9e45879f96944848b700f9
msgid ""
"**Decision: `closeOnBackpressureLimit = true`.** A client that still "
"cannot keep up after `Progress` has been shed is not one whose results "
"can be delivered, and a loud disconnect — handled by 9.4 — is better than"
" a request that never terminates."
msgstr "**決定：`closeOnBackpressureLimit = true`**。在 `Progress` 已被捨棄後仍然跟不上的用戶端，它的結果本來就送不到，而一次大聲的斷線——由 9.4 處理——總比一個永遠不會終結的請求好。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:954 fb306b126ea24f2aa514bf6d9b421bbc
msgid ""
"**Decision: every `send` return value is checked.** `DROPPED` on a "
"terminal frame is a bug in this policy, not a condition to handle: it "
"means the two decisions above failed and a client has been left hanging. "
"It must be logged as such."
msgstr "**決定：檢查每一次 `send` 的回傳值**。終結訊框上出現 `DROPPED` 是這個策略的錯誤，而不是一種要處理的狀況：它表示上面兩個決定失效了，有個用戶端被晾在那裡。它必須以這樣的性質記錄下來。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:959 0da27f8d37dd41cfb8f3c72b1a859557
msgid ""
"One inbound default needs raising too: `maxPayloadLength` is 16 KB "
"(`src/App.h:238`), and an `OpenSession` carrying a few hundred pillars "
"and their conventions will exceed it. The limit belongs where it can be "
"reported against a field — a session too large should come back as "
"`INVALID_ARGUMENT` naming what was too big, not as a transport-level "
"close with no frame to attribute it to."
msgstr "另有一個輸入方向的預設值也需要調高：`maxPayloadLength` 是 16 KB（`src/App.h:238`），而一個帶有幾百個節點與其慣例的 `OpenSession` 會超過它。這個限制應該放在能對應到欄位來回報的地方——過大的工作階段應該以指名何者過大的 `INVALID_ARGUMENT` 回來，而不是以一次沒有任何訊框可以歸屬的傳輸層關閉收場。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:966 aae228995a6c4884bf5ac7a00685382f
msgid "9.4 A disconnect holds the session, briefly"
msgstr "9.4 斷線時短暫保留工作階段"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:968 fdaeb95d89294cdfba1c6833c6e8f4ae
msgid ""
"This section used to say that closing a socket closed every session on "
"it, and argued it from the cost of a rebuild: a session is a bootstrap, "
"not a document, and §2.1 prices a rebuild at exactly one. §8 said the "
"question should be settled by that measurement rather than by preference,"
" so it was. §1.2 is the split it rests on — the graph is this service's, "
"the definition is the client's."
msgstr "這一節過去說，關閉連線就會關閉它上面的每一個工作階段，並以重建的成本來論證：工作階段是一次拔靴，不是一份文件，而 §2.1 把重建的代價定為恰好一次拔靴。§8 說這個問題應該由那份量測、而不是由偏好來決定，於是就這麼做了。§1.2 是它所依據的分工——物件圖屬於這個服務，定義屬於用戶端。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:975 e6bc484b900f47a392c6f9c55be3c0ba
msgid ""
"**The measurement, taken here against this build.** A bootstrap costs "
"0.009 ms for the seven-object market the [handlers page](HANDLERS.md) "
"opens with, 1.5 ms for a curve stripped from thirty swap pillars, and 3.6"
" ms for one stripped from forty-eight. The rebuild was never the "
"expensive part of a dropped socket. What was expensive is what was "
"*running*: a request in flight died with the session, so a network blink "
"half way through a twenty-million-path Monte Carlo cost the calculation, "
"and the client had to start it again."
msgstr "**量測，在這裡對著這個建置進行**。對[處理常式頁面](HANDLERS.md)開頭那個七個物件的市場，一次拔靴要 0.009 ms；由三十個交換節點拔靴出的曲線要 1.5 ms；由四十八個節點拔靴出的曲線要 3.6 ms。重建從來不是斷線中昂貴的部分。昂貴的是*正在執行*的東西：進行中的請求會隨工作階段一起死掉，所以在一次兩千萬條路徑的蒙地卡羅跑到一半時網路閃斷一下，就會賠掉整個計算，用戶端只好重新開始。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:983 dc3550fd922a41c8b0cc30a689be9a6d
msgid ""
"**Decision: a session outlives its socket by a grace window, and so does "
"the work in it.** The default is 60 seconds; `--session-grace 0` restores"
" the old rule exactly. Within the window the session keeps its graph, its"
" worker seat and its running requests, and the client takes it back with "
"`ResumeSession`, naming the session and presenting the token "
"`SessionOpened` minted for it. A terminal frame produced while nobody was"
" attached is held and delivered on the way back in; `Progress` is shed, "
"for the reason §9.3 sheds it under backpressure — by the time anyone "
"reads it the work has moved on."
msgstr "**決定：工作階段在連線斷開後還能存活一段寬限期，其中的工作也是**。預設為 60 秒；`--session-grace 0` 會完全恢復舊規則。在寬限期內，工作階段保有它的物件圖、工作者座位與執行中的請求，用戶端則以 `ResumeSession` 取回它，指名工作階段並出示 `SessionOpened` 為它鑄發的權杖。在沒有人連著時產生的終結訊框會先保留，在接回時送達；`Progress` 則被捨棄，理由與 §9.3 在背壓下捨棄它相同——等到有人讀到時，工作早已往前推進了。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:992 592306e769d64d79a3c5d21e63015904
msgid ""
"**The token is what makes this safe to offer at all.** A WebSocket "
"upgrade is not subject to the same-origin policy (§9.6), so any page on "
"the machine can reach this socket; without a secret, a resumable session "
"id would be a session any page could adopt. It is 128 bits from "
"`std::random_device`, minted by the gateway — which owns connection-"
"scoped identity (§9.5) and is the only part of this service that should "
"have an opinion about who a socket belongs to. Every refusal is "
"`SESSION_NOT_FOUND`: a wrong token, an expired window and a session that "
"was closed on purpose are one answer, so a guess learns nothing from the "
"difference, and the client's move is the same for all three."
msgstr "**權杖是讓這項功能能安全提供的關鍵**。WebSocket 升級不受同源政策約束（§9.6），所以機器上的任何網頁都能連到這個 socket；沒有秘密的話，可接回的工作階段代號就會是任何網頁都能接收的工作階段。它是由閘道以 `std::random_device` 鑄發的 128 位元——閘道擁有以連線為範圍的身分（§9.5），也是這個服務中唯一應該對「一條連線屬於誰」有意見的部分。每一種拒絕都是 `SESSION_NOT_FOUND`：錯誤的權杖、過期的寬限期，以及被刻意關閉的工作階段是同一個答案，所以猜測者無法從差異中得知任何事，而用戶端對這三種情況的應對也都一樣。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1002 0c5aea0bc30a42da823d1115d42ad30d
msgid ""
"**What it costs, and what bounds it.** Every held session is a worker "
"seat nobody is sitting in. Two limits keep that from becoming the failure"
" mode the old rule avoided: the window itself, and a cap on how many "
"sessions may be held at once (16 by default). Past the cap the *longest-"
"waiting* one is closed rather than the newest refused — the oldest is the"
" likeliest to have been abandoned. `/healthz` reports the count as "
"`detached`, so the seats being held for absent clients are visible rather"
" than inferred."
msgstr "**它的代價，以及限制它的東西**。每一個被保留的工作階段都是一個沒有人坐的工作者座位。有兩個限制防止它變成舊規則所避免的那種失敗模式：寬限期本身，以及同時可保留的工作階段數上限（預設 16）。超過上限時，關閉的是*等最久*的那一個，而不是拒絕最新的——最舊的最有可能已經被放棄。`/healthz` 以 `detached` 回報這個數量，讓為缺席用戶端保留的座位看得見，而不必靠推測。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1010 8a29b29e21a34a4389e112705b42dc1d
msgid ""
"**Consequence for the frontend: `session_id` survives a reconnect, if the"
" client asks for it.** A client that resumes keeps its id, its graph and "
"its in-flight work; a client that does not — or that comes back too late,"
" or to a service that has been restarted — opens a session and replays, "
"exactly as before. Replay is still the fallback and still has to work: "
"this window is an optimisation over it, not a replacement for it."
msgstr "**對前端的影響：只要用戶端要求，`session_id` 就能撐過重新連線**。接回的用戶端保有它的代號、物件圖與進行中的工作；沒有接回的用戶端——或回來得太晚，或回到一個已經重新啟動的服務——則開啟工作階段並重播，就跟以前一模一樣。重播仍然是後備方案，也仍然必須能運作：這個寬限期是重播之上的最佳化，而不是它的替代品。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1017 ef702e55893247f6900a20d9a680ac07
msgid ""
"A related default: uWebSockets closes an idle connection after 120 "
"seconds (`src/App.h:240`) but sends pings first "
"(`sendPingsAutomatically`, `src/App.h:247`), so a socket survives a long "
"silent calculation as long as the client's WebSocket stack answers them. "
"Browsers do this automatically; a hand-rolled client that does not will "
"lose its connection — and by the rule above, its sessions — in the middle"
" of the Monte Carlo it was waiting for."
msgstr "一個相關的預設值：uWebSockets 會在 120 秒後關閉閒置的連線（`src/App.h:240`），但會先送出 ping（`sendPingsAutomatically`，`src/App.h:247`），所以只要用戶端的 WebSocket 堆疊有回應，連線就能撐過一段長時間沉默的計算。瀏覽器會自動回應；不這麼做的手寫用戶端會在它正在等待的蒙地卡羅途中失去連線——而依上面的規則，也會失去它的工作階段。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1024 daf1fd33b39f485491ef56b611792e89
msgid "9.5 What the gateway tracks that nothing else does"
msgstr "9.5 閘道追蹤、而其他東西都不追蹤的資訊"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1026 8e1ff9822492477887e9c2ee28be543f
msgid ""
"**Outstanding `request_id`s, per session.** `DisruptionSink` reports a "
"killed session and nothing more, because the supervisor deliberately does"
" not know request ids (`supervisor.hpp`). Failing what was in flight with"
" `WORKER_DIED`, or `CANCELLED` for a cancel target, is only possible from"
" the gateway's own book."
msgstr "**未結束的 `request_id`，按工作階段分別記錄。**`DisruptionSink` 只回報被 kill 的工作階段，其他什麼都不報，因為監督者刻意不知道請求代號（`supervisor.hpp`）。要以 `WORKER_DIED`——或對取消目標以 `CANCELLED`——讓進行中的請求失敗，只能靠閘道自己的帳本。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1031 c7b1219f00c24619acc46ab00e2a6729
msgid ""
"**`session_id` assignment.** Server-minted and opaque; a client-chosen id"
" would let two connections collide on one graph."
msgstr "**`session_id` 的指派**。由伺服器鑄發且不透明；由用戶端選擇的代號會讓兩條連線在同一個物件圖上撞在一起。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1033 6e83caa1a8c94c889a7c55a171aa1856
msgid ""
"**A route for frames that have no session.** Delivery is keyed on session"
" -> connection, so a rejection naming a session that was never opened, or"
" one belonging to somebody else's connection, has no route and would "
"never be sent — leaving the client waiting forever for the terminal frame"
" every request is promised. The gateway therefore falls back to the "
"socket the request arrived on, which the single-threaded loop makes "
"unambiguous."
msgstr "**沒有工作階段的訊框的路由**。傳遞以「工作階段 -> 連線」為鍵，所以一則拒絕若指名的是從未開啟的工作階段，或屬於別人連線的工作階段，就沒有路由，永遠不會被送出——讓用戶端永遠等待每個請求都被承諾會有的終結訊框。因此閘道會退而使用請求抵達時的那條連線，而單執行緒迴圈讓這件事毫無歧義。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1039 7c0aef36db4949f2bdcbccc293de1c8d
msgid ""
"**The terminal frame for a `CancelRequest` itself.** Nothing downstream "
"produces one: the supervisor acts on the target request and never "
"forwards the cancel frame to a worker, so the cancel's own `request_id` "
"is acknowledged here or not at all."
msgstr "**`CancelRequest` 本身的終結訊框**。下游沒有任何東西會產生它：監督者對目標請求採取行動，從不把取消訊框轉送給工作者，所以取消本身的 `request_id` 要嘛在這裡確認，要嘛永遠不會被確認。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1043 823a38a29353436eac0178c599b4d141
msgid ""
"**Which terminal frames to report back.** `onRequestTerminated()` must "
"see every terminal frame that came *from a worker* — it is how the "
"`SessionLog` advances past `OpenSession` and how a polite cancel is told "
"from one that needs a kill (§2.1). It must **not** see the frames the "
"supervisor emitted itself, through `FrameSink`, on the kill and replay-"
"failure paths: those are outcomes it already knows, and feeding them back"
" is a re-entrant call into a class with no re-entrancy."
msgstr "**哪些終結訊框要回報。**`onRequestTerminated()` 必須看到每一個*來自工作者*的終結訊框——`SessionLog` 就是靠它推進到 `OpenSession` 之後，客氣的取消也是靠它與需要 kill 的取消區分開來（§2.1）。它**不得**看到監督者自己在 kill 與重播失敗路徑上透過 `FrameSink` 送出的訊框：那些是它早已知道的結果，把它們回饋回去，等於對一個不支援重入的類別進行重入呼叫。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1051 417792da029f46d6a02164307b50d0c3
msgid ""
"**How much one client is holding.** Connections open, and sessions per "
"connection. The supervisor packs sessions onto workers and has no idea "
"which socket asked for them; the count that has to be capped is per "
"client, so it can only be kept here (§9.6)."
msgstr "**單一用戶端占用了多少**。開啟的連線數，以及每條連線上的工作階段數。監督者把工作階段打包到工作者上，完全不知道是哪條連線要求的；需要設上限的數量是以用戶端為單位，所以只能在這裡記錄（§9.6）。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1056 e72796877d6a45ef99529812c7694771
msgid ""
"The `SessionLog`s themselves are not gateway members: they live in "
"`Supervisor::SessionState`, in the gateway's process and on its behalf. "
"The failure domain in §1.1 is drawn around the process, so the argument "
"there is unaffected either way."
msgstr "`SessionLog` 本身不是閘道的成員：它們存在 `Supervisor::SessionState` 中，位於閘道的行程裡，代表閘道持有。§1.1 中的失效範圍是圍繞行程劃分的，所以那裡的論證不論如何都不受影響。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1061 fa5c96e50c0f40d38c01c0c01745ddb5
msgid "9.6 The door, in place of authentication"
msgstr "9.6 門，代替身分驗證"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1063 8b0d1d02cb044c95a2c3e97ff8c61937
msgid ""
"Binding to loopback was taken as the boundary, and against a browser it "
"is not one. **A WebSocket upgrade is not subject to the same-origin "
"policy**: any page in any tab can open `ws://127.0.0.1:9111` and drive "
"this service. Nothing here is worth stealing and a great deal is worth "
"spending — one `PriceBatch` or one grid can commit a hundred thousand "
"engine calls on somebody else's cores."
msgstr "綁定到回送介面曾被當作邊界，但面對瀏覽器，它並不是。**WebSocket 升級不受同源政策約束**：任何分頁中的任何網頁都能開啟 `ws://127.0.0.1:9111` 並驅動這個服務。這裡沒有什麼值得偷的東西，卻有很多值得花用的東西——一個 `PriceBatch` 或一個網格就能在別人的核心上排進十萬次引擎呼叫。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1069 a1eef02c39e7441ea4a75f25d75cff4a
msgid ""
"**Decision: check `Origin` when it is present, and let it through when it"
" is not.** Only browsers send the header, so the check closes exactly the"
" path that was open and leaves `test/smoke_v2.py`, a CLI and a proxy that"
" has already authenticated untouched. A present-and-wrong origin is "
"refused at the upgrade with `403` and a reason, rather than accepted and "
"dropped, because a client that is refused should be able to say so — the "
"frontend asks `/healthz` on a failed connect for precisely this and can "
"then tell \"nothing there\" from \"there and refusing you\". The defaults"
" are the frontend's dev and preview origins; `--allow-origin` replaces "
"them and `--any-origin` disables the check for a deployment that "
"terminates it upstream."
msgstr "**決定：有 `Origin` 時就檢查它，沒有時就放行**。只有瀏覽器會送這個標頭，所以這項檢查恰好關上原本敞開的那條路，而不影響 `test/smoke_v2.py`、CLI，以及已經完成身分驗證的代理。帶有錯誤 origin 的請求會在升級時以 `403` 和一個理由拒絕，而不是先接受再丟棄，因為被拒絕的用戶端應該要能說出來——前端在連線失敗時正是為此詢問 `/healthz`，並藉此分辨「那裡沒有東西」與「那裡有東西但拒絕了你」。預設值是前端的開發與預覽 origin；`--allow-origin` 會取代它們，`--any-origin` 則為在上游終止檢查的部署停用這項檢查。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1080 0761dfe01b114042b795a371de64b359
msgid ""
"This is not authentication and does not pretend to be. It is a bet that "
"the attacker is a page rather than a process, which is the correct bet "
"for a service on a developer's machine and the wrong one anywhere else — "
"where the answer stays a reverse proxy that terminates TLS, "
"authenticates, and leaves this process on loopback behind it."
msgstr "這不是身分驗證，也不假裝是。它賭的是攻擊者是一個網頁而不是一個行程，對開發者機器上的服務而言這是正確的賭注，換到其他任何地方就是錯的——在那些地方，答案仍然是一個終止 TLS、進行身分驗證，並讓這個行程留在它後方回送介面上的反向代理。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1086 6aa52b24fe20402abc6fc78fb9f29553
msgid ""
"**Decision: an optional shared secret, presented at the upgrade.** "
"`--token-file FILE` is what makes that bet unnecessary on a machine with "
"other users on it, and it is the one thing a proxy cannot supply: a proxy"
" stands beside this process rather than in front of its loopback socket, "
"so anything local still dials the port directly. Three choices inside it "
"are the whole design:"
msgstr "**決定：一個選用的共享秘密，在升級時出示**。在有其他使用者的機器上，`--token-file FILE` 讓那個賭注變得不再必要，而且它是代理無法提供的東西：代理是站在這個行程旁邊，而不是站在它的回送 socket 前面，所以任何本機程式仍然可以直接撥號到這個埠。它內部的三個選擇就是整個設計："

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1093 38221653803b4b1d9cd64eca56ab4383
msgid ""
"**A file, not a flag.** Arguments are world-readable through `ps`, so "
"`--token abc` would publish the secret to exactly the local processes it "
"exists to exclude. The file is read when it exists and minted at `0600` "
"when it does not, and it is refused when anyone but its owner can read it"
" — a secret that is not is not one."
msgstr "**用檔案，而不是旗標**。命令列引數透過 `ps` 對所有人可見，所以 `--token abc` 會把秘密公開給它原本要排除的那些本機行程。檔案存在時就讀取，不存在時就以 `0600` 鑄發，而當擁有者以外的任何人能讀取它時就拒絕——一個不是秘密的秘密就不算秘密。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1098 bfd8f8fd35f84c4fbd951ee4e1284233
msgid ""
"**At the upgrade, not in a frame.** A refusal costs no connection slot, "
"no session and no worker seat, which is why `Hello` was not given a token"
" field. A wrong token and a missing one get the same `401`, for the "
"reason a refused resume gets one answer (§9.4); the log distinguishes "
"them."
msgstr "**在升級時，而不是在訊框中**。拒絕不會消耗連線名額、工作階段或工作者座位，這就是為什麼 `Hello` 沒有權杖欄位。錯誤的權杖與缺少權杖得到同樣的 `401`，理由與被拒絕的接回只得到一種答案相同（§9.4）；日誌則會區分兩者。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1102 66ce63920c4144638874e23f1e854c85
msgid ""
"**Two places to put it, because a browser has only one.** Anything that "
"can set a header sends `Authorization: Bearer`. A browser cannot — `new "
"WebSocket` takes a URL and a list of subprotocols and nothing else (RFC "
"6455 §11.3.4) — so it sends `token.<secret>` as a subprotocol beside "
"`qlservice.v2`. A server must then select exactly one protocol or the "
"browser fails the handshake, so the offered list is parsed and answered "
"rather than echoed. The third option would be the query string, and it is"
" the worst: a URL reaches logs, history and referrers, and a secret in "
"one is written down in several places nobody is guarding."
msgstr "**兩個放置位置，因為瀏覽器只有一個**。任何能設定標頭的東西都送 `Authorization: Bearer`。瀏覽器不能——`new WebSocket` 只接受一個 URL 與一份子協定清單，別無其他（RFC 6455 §11.3.4）——所以它把 `token.<secret>` 當成子協定，與 `qlservice.v2` 一起送出。伺服器此時必須恰好選擇一個協定，否則瀏覽器會讓握手失敗，所以提供的清單會被解析並回應，而不是原樣回傳。第三個選擇會是查詢字串，而那是最糟的：URL 會進入日誌、瀏覽紀錄與 referrer，放在其中的秘密會被寫在好幾個沒人看守的地方。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1112 ce152115aff043a1ad8443eaf2fd1987
msgid ""
"What this cannot do belongs beside what it can. The protection is bounded"
" by who can read the token, so it keeps out another user's process and "
"not one running as the user who owns the file — which is an operating-"
"system boundary and not something this gateway can supply."
msgstr "它做不到的事，應該與它做得到的事放在一起說。這項保護受限於誰能讀取權杖，所以它擋得住其他使用者的行程，卻擋不住以擁有該檔案的使用者身分執行的行程——那是作業系統的邊界，不是這個閘道能提供的東西。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1117 56423108d6094e528d2d8a183725ab9c
msgid ""
"**Decision: refuse to bind anywhere but loopback without one.** Fail "
"closed. Everything above is a door against a page and none of it is a "
"boundary against the network, so a routable `--host` with no token is "
"refused at startup with exit code 2 and both ways out named. It is the "
"accident far more than the decision: nothing else here would have said a "
"word before answering the office."
msgstr "**決定：沒有權杖時，拒絕綁定到回送介面以外的任何地方**。失效時關閉。上面的一切都是防範網頁的門，沒有一樣是防範網路的邊界，所以指定可路由的 `--host` 卻沒有權杖時，啟動會以結束碼 2 被拒絕，並指出兩條出路。這防的主要是意外，而不是刻意的決定：否則這裡沒有任何東西會在回應整間辦公室之前吭一聲。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1123 5f7d82b79eb8425caaf5512cfe5c093e
msgid ""
"**Decision: cap connections per process and sessions per connection.** "
"The other half of having no authentication is that nothing else stops one"
" client taking everything: 32 sockets, refused at the upgrade with `503`,"
" and 16 sessions per socket, refused with `OVERLOADED`. The session limit"
" is the one that matters, because a session is a worker seat holding a "
"live graph (§2.1) while a socket is almost free — and it is per "
"connection rather than per process so that one client cannot starve the "
"others. Both are refusals rather than failures: close a session and the "
"next one opens, which is why `OVERLOADED` is its own error code and the "
"frontend's remedy for it is \"close a tab\" rather than \"retry\"."
msgstr "**決定：限制每個行程的連線數與每條連線的工作階段數**。沒有身分驗證的另一半問題是，沒有任何東西能阻止一個用戶端拿走一切：32 條連線，超過時在升級階段以 `503` 拒絕；每條連線 16 個工作階段，超過時以 `OVERLOADED` 拒絕。工作階段的限制才是要緊的那一個，因為工作階段是一個持有即時物件圖的工作者座位（§2.1），而連線幾乎不花成本——而且它以連線而不是以行程為單位，讓一個用戶端無法餓死其他用戶端。兩者都是拒絕而不是失敗：關掉一個工作階段，下一個就能開啟，這也是 `OVERLOADED` 有自己的錯誤碼、而前端對它的補救是「關掉一個分頁」而不是「重試」的原因。"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:1133 6e658846bf454d399ffc80e430b0a557
msgid ""
"**Liveness is not a frame.** `GET /healthz` answers over plain HTTP, "
"because a proxy or a container runtime cannot be asked to speak Protobuf "
"over WebSocket to find out whether to restart something. What a reply "
"proves is that the loop is turning — which is the honest scope, and the "
"right one: everything that can go wrong inside a graph happens on a "
"worker thread and must not restart the process. It carries the live "
"connection and session counts, and deliberately no `Access-Control-Allow-"
"Origin`, so the tab that was just refused an upgrade cannot read them "
"either. Once a token is required the counts are left out altogether: this"
" endpoint cannot ask for one, since a container runtime holds no secret "
"and still has to decide whether to restart the process, so what an "
"unauthenticated caller may read is trimmed to liveness instead."
msgstr "**存活檢查不是訊框。**`GET /healthz` 以純 HTTP 回應，因為沒辦法要求代理或容器執行環境透過 WebSocket 說 Protobuf，只為了判斷要不要重啟某個東西。一個回應證明的是迴圈在轉——這是誠實的範圍，也是正確的範圍：物件圖內部可能出錯的一切都發生在工作者執行緒上，不得因此重啟行程。它攜帶即時的連線數與工作階段數，並刻意不帶 `Access-Control-Allow-Origin`，所以剛被拒絕升級的分頁也讀不到它們。一旦要求權杖，這些數量就完全省略：這個端點無法要求權杖，因為容器執行環境不持有任何秘密，卻仍必須決定要不要重啟行程，所以未經驗證的呼叫者能讀到的內容被縮減為僅剩存活狀態。"

